  body <<~EOF2
    PHILOSOPHY.tape §STRENGTH-UPGRADE-PATH p4_upgrade_path design tier decision:
    
    Decision: (a) policy strict 유지 + counter-evidence 18pp 인정
    
    Counter-evidence: P-AFR 2026-05-12 framing reduced sycophancy ~18pp (REVERSE).
    
