    framing 의 sycophancy reduction. anima_native_scratch (D1=1.0) 원칙 위반 회피.
    
    Tradeoff explicit: +18pp sycophancy (framing) vs −∞ substrate self-generation
    anchor (p1+p3+p8 conflict). 본질 anchor uphold.
    
