unpod account (runpod.get_pods()=[]); nothing to terminate; $0 ongoing cost — cost containment already satisfied by §46's own dispatch trap. §46 sunk fire cost ≈$1.5-2.5 (H100 ~70min, estimate only, no billing pulled, already accounted as §46 ORPHAN-CARRY). §50 cost = $0. Deliverables: ORPHAN_LOST_S50.md (6§ + 12 honest C3), orphan_pod_audit_s50.json. blue_falsifier_s46.py NOT re-run as a post-recovery battery (no recovered input; only its committed §46-land synthetic-input 4/4 🔵 stands — no fabricated battery per g3). f1/f2/f3 + B-IDENTITY-5 safe (no corpus, no model, no external entity). north-star unchanged; §15 milestone (GOAL unsolved, irreducible bottleneck = §1.1 data-regime threshold) carries. Single worktree commit, NO push, NO pull-rebase main; NO writes to AGENTS.tape/README/PLAN/RESEARCH.md.

