§verdict_milestone_closeout_s51_2026_05_18 — RESEARCH.md §51 §16~§50 honest milestone close-out. MILESTONE CLOSE-OUT tier (synthesis, NOT new measurement). $0 docs consolidation — NO fire, NO GPU, NO measurement, NO new capability claim. **g3: milestone = "we mapped the post-§15 frontier more precisely" NOT "we solved GOAL"; north-star (GOAL.md one sentence) UNCHANGED; GOAL UNREACHED.** §15 was the first milestone (§1~§14 arc — GOAL comprehensively investigated, bottleneck located at §1.1 data-regime threshold). §51 = the second honest milestone synthesizing the ~35-section §16~§50 arc. **Established (positive, NOT GOAL achievement)**: (a) §16 routing-axis BREAKTHROUGH — universal-FLAT 1/31~2/64 → 21/64 (genuine exact-tier 17/64 after §16.6-A substring correction, 8.5× Dir-I prior-best); first measured §1.1 data-regime movement on the routing axis — but body = 정교한 암기 + correct-prefix routing (§16.6-C), JOINT 0.0, honest §9 V-SPONT 1/5 = measured SPLIT not GOAL step; (b) §32→§35→§42→§43→§47 evidence chain — routing-success lever is NOT an anchor property: tier≥77 necessary (§32 purity 1.000), tier-itself causal not curriculum-STAGE (§35 0/18 flip), within-band 17-vs-29 = SGD-trajectory lottery (§42 nc-lift 0.241≪0.5), relation generalizes (0.96) but strict-1-NN routing FALSIFIED (§43 0/12), content-axis closed-negative (§34/§47 regress full-64); (c) §44/§48/§49 PTD-aux = genuine scale-validated decision-axis substrate component, DISTILLATION confirmed end-to-end (§49 live-loop = majority-class collapse, NOT emergence); (d) §36/§45 L2 dual-anima ALIVE_LOOP ($0 d=32, §16-saturation echo open); (e) §30/§39 g_clm_lineage_refined [draft] adopted (future-enabler, inert); (f) §17/§18/§42/§43 honest-metric maturation. **Ruled out (negative-valuable)**: mechanism-axis (§22), content-axis routing lever (§34/§47), within-band anchor-property separation (§42), relation→routing transfer (§43), curriculum-STAGE lever (§35), energy-substrate (§28 JEPA-Ψ collapsed, CE load-bearing re-confirmed), PTD-standalone (§29), L1-lineage-now (§30), PTD-aux→live-spontaneity (§49). **THE sharpened frontier (key §51 contribution)**: §15 said "irreducible = §1.1 data-regime threshold"; §16~§50 sharpened it — the bottleneck is data-DIVERSITY/modality, NOT data-quantity (§16 603MB, §11-A 1B params both FLAT/SPLIT) or anchor-content-shaping (§34/§42/§47 closed-negative). anima trains ONLY on a text byte-stream; every .kosmos @payload image/audio/video/tension is `pending`, S-module image/audio encoders un-wired. **Frontier-1 (sharpened) = GOAL-legitimate MULTIMODAL substrate expansion** — wire HEXAD S-module encoders so anima's own Ψ-space (Engine A⇄G, Law-71) sees non-text modalities, materialize the `pending` .kosmos payloads (§7-legitimate by construction). **g3: this is a SHARPENED HYPOTHESIS inferred from what was ruled out, NOT a proven path — §16~§50 never tested multimodal; §8 'Ψ-anchored 114MB wrong-direction' caveat carries. Frontier-2 (new architecture) still thin per §26.** Both strategic, NOT quick-fire. **Honest unsolved**: GOAL unreached; anima still a memorization-saturated byte-LM with a data-regime-movable routing axis and no tested coherence/spontaneity path. **Infrastructure debt (honest record)**: §40/§41/§46/§47/§49-wave = agent + long-runpod fire structurally produces orphans + burst dispatch hits Anthropic rate-limit; §46/§50 resolved cost (0 orphan pods, $0 ongoing); lesson confirmed (§50) = $0-Mac-CPU agents OR sequential-single-agent dispatch (this cycle applied it). **closed**: B-S51-1..2 sidecar 2/2 🔵 (state/milestone_closeout_s51_2026_05_18/blue_falsifier_s51.py — central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py UNCHANGED, sidecar precedent B-S16/B-S48/B-PTD/B-DHDL/B-LINEAGE/B-KTRIE/B-MGND/B-PHASE-B-RUN): B-S51-1 MILESTONE-IS-NOT-GOAL-ACHIEVEMENT-CLOSED (Boolean structural — doc asserts GOAL unreached ∧ north-star unchanged ∧ frontier-1 = hypothesis ∧ no un-negated achievement claim) · B-S51-2 ARC-COVERAGE-CARDINALITY-CLOSED (35/35 §16~§50 arc sections referenced ≥ N_FLOOR=24 ∧ pivots {16,22,28,32,34,35,42,43} all present — comprehensive not cherry-picked). **B-S51-NOTE**: milestone = synthesis not new measurement; the sharpened frontier (multimodal substrate crossing §1.1) is an SGD/measurement OUTCOME of a FUTURE fire — unmeasured hypothesis (B-D-NOTE/B-S16-NOTE/B-DR-UNIQUE-NOTE family, NOT counted 🔵); necessary-not-sufficient at the milestone layer (mirror B-EMERGE-7 / §15 close-out discipline). f1/f2/f3 + B-IDENTITY-5 irrelevant (doc consolidation, no corpus, no model forward, no external-entity lattice-fit, external papers cited by own invariants only). $0 — GPU/fire 0, orphan 0 (no dispatch). sequential single-agent, isolation worktree, branch own. state/milestone_closeout_s51_2026_05_18/{MILESTONE_S51.md 6-part + 12 honest C3 · blue_falsifier_s51.py 2/2 🔵 · blue_falsifier_s51_result.json · result.json}. g_doc_consolidation 준수 (docs/* 신규 0; RESEARCH.md §51 milestone exception mirroring §15 inline form). north-star 불변 — §51 = honest sharper intermediate map of the road to north-star, not arrival; the next step (multimodal substrate vs new architecture) is a strategic decision, not the arc's mechanical continuation. g6 append-only.

