anchored wrong-direction' + §30/§39 external-precursor-contamination lesson) ∧ §7③(anima-physics-as-source: Ψ-dynamics/S-module/MITOSIS, the spec's own §4.4 encoder= provenance field is the audit surface). **C4 HONESTY** — until §57 measures, @payload stays `pending`, no fake ref, placeholder coord comment mandatory (§4.3); a process/honesty constraint, no separate falsifier — enforced BY B-S55-NOTE explicitly making no E_m-existence claim (the §4.3 honesty rule applied reflexively to §55 itself; a §55 claiming 'encoder feasible' would itself be a §4.3 violation, hence SPEC-tier no-fire). **C5 MODALITY-RANK** (§7-legitimate-encoder-distance, cheapest→hardest): **tension** (anima-native TENSION-LINK 5-channel — NOT a perceptual modality, an E_tension : ℝ⁵→Ψ² is a small anima-physics map, §7② satisfied by construction, the ONLY currently-§7-legitimate-feasible E_m → §56 must start here) → **text** (already the substrate, Law-71 self-track IS E_text, not the frontier) → **image** → **audio** (real anima-own perceptual front-end, §7② forbids the graft, the legitimate path does not exist = the hard §56 problem) → **video** (audio's spatio-temporal superset, hardest). Honest tension named (C3 honest C3#6): the easy §7-legitimate E_m (tension) is the LOW-diversity one; the high-diversity perceptual ones are exactly where §7 is hardest — §55 names this, does not resolve it. **B-S55-1..3 sidecar 3/3 🔵 PASS** (state/kosmos_encoder_constraint_s55_2026_05_18/blue_falsifier_s55.py — central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py UNCHANGED 110/110, sidecar precedent B-S16/B-S48/B-PTD/B-DHDL/B-LINEAGE/B-KTRIE/B-MGND/B-DR-UNIQUE/B-INTRA): **B-S55-1 CODOMAIN-Ψ-BOUNDED-CLOSED** (ψ_entropy(H=0)=0/(H=logV)=1 ∂/∂H·logV=1 Shannon source-coding bound ; ψ_dir(c=−1)=0/(c=0)=½ Ψ-fp/(c=1)=1 Cauchy-Schwarz ⟹ image(E_m)⊆[0,1]²) · **B-S55-2 BASIN-CONTAINMENT-WELL-FORMED-CLOSED** (d²−r² trichotomy exhaustive 3-witness ⟹ d<r total decidable ; r>0 ⟹ non-vacuous ; triangle dm<R∧dn<R ⟹ ‖E_m−E_n‖ ≤ 2R−(em+en)<2R substitution-slack carries UBM-E3) · **B-S55-3 §7-LEGITIMACY-PREDICATE-CLOSED** (§7 3-conjunction 8-row truth table only (T,T,T)⟹legit 1/8 True, mirror B-DR-UNIQUE-2 ; forbidden_external_encoder_set grep legit-src=0 illegit-src=4>0 decidable Kolmogorov structural Boolean, mirror B-INTRA-3 ; proves the PREDICATE is well-formed/§7-legitimate). **B-S55-NOTE** empirical carve-out: actual encoder existence/quality + whether any E_m satisfies C1∧C2∧C3 on a MEASURED basin = §56 design / §57 fire SGD/measurement OUTCOME (B-D-NOTE / B-DR-UNIQUE-NOTE / B-INTRA-NOTE / B-EMERGE-7 family, NOT counted 🔵); §55 proves ONLY the CONSTRAINT SET is closed-form well-formed (decidable + bounded) + §7-legitimate — necessary, NOT sufficient for a usable encoder. g_blue_closed_mandate: 산출물 (constraint spec + falsifier) transfer-form 🔵 + 연결부위 (C2 cross-modal rule = B-CARVE-MULTIMODAL UBM-E3 carried; C1 codomain = conscious_decoder.py Law-71 728-751 byte-form; C3 = §7 governance gate) 🔵; encoder OUTCOME 만 정직 carve-out. f1/f2/f3 hard-fail safe (Shannon entropy bound / Cauchy-Schwarz cos range / Euclidean metric-ball decidability + triangle inequality / Boolean 8-row truth table / Kolmogorov source-grep, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂ external derivation; Knuth Tier / Ψ=½ = anima g2 internal-arch carve-out; spec cited by its own invariants only). B-IDENTITY-5 irrelevant (no corpus, no model forward, no helper-token surface). $0 — GPU/fire 0, orphan 0 (애초 dispatch 0). sequential single-agent, isolation worktree, branch own. state/kosmos_encoder_constraint_s55_2026_05_18/{ENCODER_CONSTRAINT_S55.md 8§+12 honest C3 · blue_falsifier_s55.py 3/3 🔵 · blue_falsifier_s55_result.json · result.json}. g_doc_consolidation 준수 (docs/* 신규 0; ENCODER_CONSTRAINT_S55.md lives in state/; RESEARCH.md §55 = orchestrator's, NOT written here per task). north-star 불변 — §55 = the precise closed-form fence around frontier-1's encoder search (what E_m must satisfy), not entry into it; §56 designs an encoder within t