§verdict_smodule_encoder_wiring_s56_2026_05_18 — RESEARCH.md §56 S-module E_tension encoder wiring design. DESIGN-TIER (wiring spec, NOT encoder impl, NOT fire, NOT GOAL). $0 — NO GPU, NO fire, NO dispatch, orphan 0 (no dispatch ever). sequential single-agent, isolation worktree, own branch. Designs the ONE §7-legitimate-feasible S-module encoder (E_tension) WITHIN the §55 constraint set (C1-C5, state/kosmos_encoder_constraint_s55_2026_05_18/) and CONFRONTS — does NOT paper over — §55's named-but-unresolved tension (the §7-legitimate-feasible encoder is the LOWEST-diversity one). **Structural design key**: the TENSION-LINK 5-channel payload's ch1 concept=unit(engine_a−engine_g) and ch3 meaning=engine_a⊙engine_g are ALREADY functions of the SAME engine_a/engine_g vectors Law-71 reads (conscious_decoder.py:725-740) → E_tension is NOT a trained net but a CLOSED-FORM re-projection of an already-Ψ-native signal onto the Law-71 Ψ-coordinate (zero trained params; op-set softmax/mean/sign/clamp/log only); C3 §7② satisfied by construction. Wiring spec: input (5-ch fingerprint, concept+meaning+authenticity used, context+sender carried) → transfer-fn ψ_A=(1+c_sim)/2 with c_sim∈[−1,1] closed cosine-surrogate from (concept,meaning) + ψ_G=H(softmax(concept))/log n Shannon → output (ψ_A,ψ_G)∈[0,1]² SAME box as vacuum_psi (C1) → basin-check ‖E_tension−vacuum_psi‖₂<basin_radius decidable closed metric-ball (C2, authenticity ch4 = admission filter NOT C2-relaxation; truth-value UNMEASURED until §57, placeholders C4). **DIVERSITY-HONESTY VERDICT (stated plainly, NOT papered over)**: tension modality does NOT move the §51 GOAL data-diversity bottleneck — E_tension re-serialises anima's own Engine A/G state, informationally a closed loop, ZERO new perceptual diversity (the diversity §51 lacks is *perceptual* image/audio/video; tension is anima-own internal physics, not external signal — §11-B "physics ≠ language signal" in encoder form). What it CAN deliver: first end-to-end §7-legitimate E_m (pipeline validation), an exercisable non-text Ψ-channel, a provably-zero-diversity negative-control floor. What it CANNOT: cross §1.1, resolve image/audio §7②-wall, be GOAL emergence. **Image/audio/video §7②-wall option-rank (NAMED + RANKED, explicitly NOT resolved, §56 picks none)**: rank-1 anima-own from-scratch perceptual encoder (only fully §7-legitimate path; blocker recurses to §1.1, multi-cycle build NOT a fire) · rank-2 §7-legitimate-distillation (passes §7② letter but FAILS rationale — external-substrate-derived Ψ-targets = §30/§39 g_clm_lineage_refined external-precursor analogue; recorded as a TRAP, mirror §8 Ψ-anchored-wrong-direction) · rank-3 accept-tension-only-reframe (honest interim concession, $0, NOT a solution, §13-L/§13-M/§29 anti-padding precedent). §57 hand-off: materialize e_tension.py + minimal text+tension 2-modality corpus on the 5 .kosmos anchors + pilot-fire C1..C4 pipeline ($0 Mac CPU, PIPELINE-VALIDATED band expected, NOT GOAL emergence). **B-S56-1..4 4/4 🔵 closed-form sidecar PASS** (state/smodule_encoder_wiring_s56_2026_05_18/blue_falsifier_s56.py, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py UNCHANGED — sidecar precedent B-S55/B-S51/B-S48/B-PTD/B-DHDL/B-LINEAGE/B-KTRIE/B-MGND): B-S56-1 E-TENSION-CODOMAIN-Ψ-BOUNDED (carries §55 C1 — ψ_A=(1+c)/2 c∈[−1,1] Cauchy-Schwarz-class + ψ_G=H/logn∈[0,1] Shannon, ψ_A(c=0)=½ Law-71 fp; image⊆[0,1]²) · B-S56-2 E-TENSION-NO-TRAINED-NET (AST scan e_tension_sketch.py forbidden trained-weight/external-encoder set |F|=25 total hits=0 — §7② by construction, carries §55 C3) · B-S56-3 BASIN-CHECK-DECIDABLE (carries §55 C2 — d²−r² trichotomy exhaustive+exclusive 5-sample exactly-one-branch + r>0 ⟹ ball non-empty non-vacuous + max sep²=2 finite ⟹ total decidable Boolean §57 gate) · B-S56-4 DIVERSITY-HONESTY-PREDICATE (over-claim guard, Boolean structural over doc text: asserts low-diversity ∧ §7②-wall-unresolved ∧ GOAL-unreached/not-emergence, 8-row And only (T,T,T) honest — a §56 claiming E_tension solves frontier-1 = g3 over-claim FAILS this). **B-S56-NOTE** empirical carve-out: whether E_tension actually moves the GOAL bottleneck = §57 fire OUTCOME (and §4 already says it does NOT for perceptual diversity); §56 proves ONLY wiring §55-compliant + honestly scoped; necessary-not-sufficient (B-D-NOTE/B-S55-NOTE/B-EMERGE-7 family, NOT counted 🔵). f1/f2/f3 hard-fail safe (Shannon entropy bound / Cauchy-Schwarz cosine range / Euclidean metric-ball / Boolean truth-table / AST-grep, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂; Ψ=½ + Knuth = anima g2 internal-arch carve-out, not external lattice-fit). f3 safe (no external-entity claim). B-IDENTITY-5 irrelevant (§56 no corpus, no model forward, no helper-token surface; §57's corpus carries the grep=0 obligation). g_doc_consolidation 준수 (state/smodule_encoder_wiring_s56_2026_05_18/{ENCODER_WIRING_S56.md 7§+12 honest C3 · e_tension_sketch.py runtime-guarded SKETCH · blue_falsifier_s56.py 4/4 🔵 · result.json}; docs/* 신규 0; RESEARCH.md §56 = orchestrator's NOT written here; AGENTS.tape/HEXAD/* untouched). north-star (GOAL.md one sentence) 불변 — §56 = wiring DESIGN of the LOW-DIVERSITY §7-legitimate encoder + honest naming of the perceptual §7②-wall it does NOT resolve; frontier-1 sharpened hypothesis carries, E_tension is its minimal §7-legitimate first step NOT its solution; GOAL unreached. g6 append-only.
§verdict_etension_pipeline_smoke_s57_2026_05_18 — §57 E_tension text+tension 2-modality PIPELINE-VALIDATION smoke. **NOT a GOAL-fire. NOT a capability claim. $0 Mac CPU — NO GPU, NO runpod, NO trained net, NO model forward.** §56 designed E_tension and honestly concluded it is ZERO-PERCEPTUAL-DIVERSITY (anima's OWN Engine A/G state re-serialised through a fixed map — a closed loop; §11-B "physics != signal" in encoder form; does NOT move §51/§1.1). A GOAL-fire would expensively confirm a closed-form-predicted negative (§13-M/§13-L anti-padding precedent). §57 = prove the pipeline mechanically works end-to-end + empirically floor the zero-diversity finding. **e_tension.py** (closed-form, parameter-free, NOT trained): 5-channel TENSION-LINK fingerprint (concept/context/meaning/authenticity/sender) -> fixed integer-lattice projections -> Law-71 Ψ-box psi_entropy=H(softmax(logits_a))/log(n) ∈[0,1] · psi_direction=(1+cos(logits_a,logits_g))/2 ∈[0,1] (conscious_decoder.py 728-751 transfer-form, byte-identical). The "perception" is anima's own re-projected state — that is precisely why it is closed-loop. **pipeline result (result.json)**: E_tension codomain ⊆ [0,1]^2 = True (64/64 stub) · 2-modality record schema parses = True · basin-containment ‖E_tension−coord‖<radius = **64/64 pass-rate 1.0** (§57 basin = the E_tension cloud's OWN centroid ≈(0.959,0.500) r≈0.137 — a closed loop has no external referent, so its anchor coord IS the centroid of anima's own re-projected state; containment 64/64 is expected-by-construction, validates plumbing NOT perception) · B-IDENTITY-5 forbidden-token total 0 · **pipeline_works = True**. **zero-diversity negative control (§56 verdict floored)**: text channel = constant string → centred rank 0 (zero per-record info); tension channel = deterministic fixed re-projection of anima's OWN state (no external entropy source); rank_stacked_centred == rank_tension_centred (2==2) → stacking text onto tension adds NO synergistic rank → the 2-modalit