pse content-driven (escapable by objective surgery) OR data-shape-driven (NOT escapable alone)? FOUR regimes + structural OFF: flat (negative control, MUST collapse — smoke-validity gate), majority (~95%-one-class = §27/§48 corpus shape = honest §49-echo stress), diverse (synthetic dynamic), real_w_s59 (LOAD-BEARING — the recorded §59-FIRE anima W-state trace SHAPE from state/ptd_w_native_fire_s59_2026_05_18/result.json::w_physics_trace, 283.72M/6000-step actual trajectory downsampled 300 to _real_w_trace_s59.json; NO model.forward — recorded trajectory only; §59-FIRE confirmed read-out LIVE here, §68 tests GENERATIVITY of that same trajectory). Honest non-degeneracy predicate = §49's OWN ≥95%-one-class definition: non_degenerate = (decision_var > τ=1e-4) ∧ (majority_fraction < 0.95) — a distribution ≥95% one class IS the §49 collapse by §49's own definition (prior stub's 0.999 cut let a 1/300 emit on a constant stream pass — fixed so the flat negative control correctly collapses, no over-claim). VERDICT BY MEASUREMENT (g3, raw): GENERATIVE-ON-REAL-W-STATE-AT-SMOKE. Measured: flat n=300 base-rate 0.0000 → ON non-degenerate FALSE maj_frac 1.0000 0 emits (negative control correctly COLLAPSES → smoke VALID); majority n=300 base-rate 0.0767 → ON non-degenerate FALSE maj_frac 0.9900 3/297 emits (the §49 collapse RE-APPEARS as a pure class-imbalance attractor on the §27/§48-shaped quiet stream — even with content removed + label physics-derived); diverse n=300 base-rate 0.4000 → ON non-degenerate TRUE maj_frac 0.5652 dec_var 0.24575 130 emits (escapes); real_w_s59 n=300 base-rate 0.7700 → ON non-degenerate TRUE maj_frac 0.7926 dec_var 0.16436 237 emits (GENERATIVE — the §59-FIRE-confirmed-live W-state trajectory is a dynamic ramp-up tension 0.26→58 ~29% below half-mean, NOT §27/§48-style majority-quiet, so the relative-surprise label fires richly and the label-free predictor does NOT collapse). HONEST SPLIT (g3, both halves reported, no over-claim): the §59-FIRE-confirmed