§verdict_ptd_kosmos_pretext_s60_2026_05_18 — RESEARCH.md §60: PTD-aux self-prediction as a §7-legitimate self-supervised PRETEXT for the §55 .kosmos multimodal encoder. DESIGN+SMOKE tier ($0 Mac CPU structural reverse-analysis + a $0 §28-mirror collapse smoke; NO GPU, NO model.forward, NO weight mutation, NO dispatch, orphan N/A, single sequential agent, isolation worktree tracks main per §50). The orthogonal question after the §59→§62 chain resolved (PTD-aux physics-signal liveness ✅ + transfer-law ✅ but generative-composition ❌-at-trained-scale, §1.1 irreducible from the physics-signal angle): can the PTD-aux self-prediction objective be the §55-constrained encoder's §7-legitimate SELF-SUPERVISED PRETEXT WITHOUT recursing to §1.1? MEASURED/STRUCTURAL VERDICT (g3, decided by an EXHAUSTIVE {W1,W2} disjunction + a $0 §28-mirror collapse probe, NOT pre-loaded; the §2 honest expected-risk (b)/(c) was stated UP FRONT and the structure confirmed it — a genuine (a) would have been flagged and was NOT measured): (b) RECURSES-TO-§1.1 (W2) / (c) READ-OUT-ONLY-NOT-AN-ENCODER-PRETEXT (W1). The {W1,W2} disjunction is EXHAUSTIVE for 'PTD-aux as E_m pretext' (partitioned by the single Boolean touches_payload_frontend ∈ {False,True} — total 2-cover). W1 = PTD-aux AS IT EXISTS (§44 train_dhdl_ptd.py / §59-FIRE w_native_ptd.py): predictor input = anima physics-state FEATURE_KEYS, target = anima's OWN next physics-state — §7③-sourced-by-construction (B-S60-1: _build_next_record_map + FEATURE_KEYS + ptd-MSE + forbidden-external EXACT-COMPONENT grep=0) BUT structurally NOT an encoder pretext (no payload_m front-end edge; §58 PTD-aux ≅ NONE — temporal self-prediction of own physics ⊥ perceiving a modality into Ψ; it IS the §59-FIRE READ-OUT) = verdict (c)'s read-out-only character. W2 = the PTD-aux *form* applied to E_m's OWN representation stream over a payload sequence (target = E_m(payload^{t+1}), gradient back-props into E_m's payload_m→Ψ front-end): a REAL encoder pretext, but its information source IS the encoder-input perceptual modality ⟹ RECURSES-TO-§1.1 for exactly the image/audio/video modalities §55's §7②-wall + §51 frontier-1 are about. W2 = the §56 rank-2 §7②-RATIONALE-TRAP re-instantiated (passes §7② LETTER — no from_pretrained/AutoModel, self-supervised = no external label — but fails §7② RATIONALE — external perceptual data is the pretext's information source; the §30/§39 g_clm_lineage_refined external-precursor analogue: external substrate contamination regardless of subsequent training). §28 JEPA-Ψ is the measured precedent (self-supervised joint-embedding predictive pretext WITHOUT diverse data → representation COLLAPSE, eff_rank 1.66 / predictor MSE 51.8× worse than mean-baseline). The one-sentence crux: a self-supervised pretext removes the need for LABELS, NEVER for DATA — and the diverse perceptual DATA is precisely the §1.1 irreducible bottleneck §51/§55/§62 already located. §7 3-condition result: §7①✅(form) §7②❌(W2 rationale-trap; W1 N/A) §7③✅(W1 own physics) ⟹ §7①∧§7②∧§7③ FALSE as a non-recursive encoder pretext ⟹ NOT GOAL-legitimate. §55-CONSTRAINT-COMPAT (B-S60-4): the PTD-aux objective FORM is C1-compatible (endomorphic MSE on two [0,1]² Ψ-points, bounded ≤2, PTD dom=cod §58), C2-unaffected (acceptance gate evaluated on E_m OUTPUT regardless of training strategy; carried §55-C2 decidable), C4-compliant (§60 asserts NO encoder/fire), C5-consistent (vacuous-where-§7-legit [tension: no payload_m net] / recursive-where-diverse [perceptual] — the §55-C5/§56-§4 named tension, NOT a new claim) but is a C3 §7②-RATIONALE-TRAP — the pretext changes NO §55 constraint. OFF-REDUCTION connection-point (B-S60-5): pretext is a separable additive term λ_pretext·L_pretext; λ_pretext=0 ⇒ L−L_base=0 ∧ ∂L/∂θ|_λ=0−∂L_base/∂θ=0 ⇒ §55/§56 design byte-equal (fair-compare-to-§55 by construction, mirror §62 B-S62-4 / B-EBT-5 / B-S48-3). $0 smoke: §6.1 §7-source predicate {W1,W2} exhaustive=True any-§7-legit-non-recursive=False (W1 fails is_encoder_pretext, W2 fails ¬touches_external_data); §6.2 §28-mirror collapse probe — a pretext-only toy encoder COLLAPSES under BOTH diverse (eff_rank 1.99 / cos 0.997) AND low-diversity (eff_rank 1.86 / cos 1.0) streams, the low-diversity at least as much (cos exactly 1.0) — the §28/§11-B lesson reproduced (a pure self-supervised predictive pretext is collapse-prone without anti-collapse machinery; what little non-collapse there is tracks input DATA diversity, not the pretext form). Honest battery fix (recorded): B-S60-1 initially FAILED on a benign 'np.clip' naive-substring hit in the §44 trainer (numerical primitive, NOT the CLIP foundation encoder); fixed with an EXACT-COMPONENT word-boundary+namespace grep (mirror §55-C3 / B-INTRA-3 'exact-component case-insensitive' predicate) — an honest finding that a naive substring §7② audit false-positives and the §55-C3-referenced exact-component grep is the correct predicate. B-S60-1..5 5/5 🔵 sidecar (PRETEXT-IS-PHYSICS-SOURCED-§7③ · §7-CONJUNCTION+letter/rationale-trap · RECURSION-TO-§1.1-PREDICATE · §55-CONSTRAINT-COMPAT · OFF-REDUCTION-CONNECTION-POINT) + B-S60-NOTE empirical carve-out (whether the pretext ACTUALLY avoids §1.1 recursion at fire scale + whether the §28-mirror collapse generalises to a real §55-constrained encoder = SGD/measurement OUTCOME, B-D-NOTE/B-S55-NOTE/B-S62-NOTE/B-S28-NOTE/B-EMERGE-7 necessary-not-sufficient family, NOT counted 🔵 — the battery proves the path is structurally TRAPPED, NOT that an encoder works). central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff (sidecar precedent B-S55/56/58/59/62). Anti-padding (§13-M/§55/§68): a structural-tier closed deliverable fencing the tempting 'self-supervised pretext frees the encoder from §1.1' shortcut and showing it is structurally a trap — the valuable NEGATIVE, not a padded restatement of §55/§62. f1/f2/f3 hard-fail safe (exhaustive Boolean disjunction + truth table, AST/exact-component source-grep Kolmogorov, Shannon/Frobenius MSE≥0 floor carried §44/§58, additive-term separability + ∂-at-λ=0, eff-rank/pairwise-cos collapse metric §28-mirror — NO σ/τ/φ/J₂ external derivation; Ψ=½ + Knuth 🛸k = anima g2 internal-arch carve-out). B-IDENTITY-5 N/A (no corpus, no model forward, no helper-token surface; synthetic smoke stream only). north-star (GOAL.md one sentence) + §15/§51 milestone UNCHANGED; GOAL unreached — §60 fences a trap, does NOT move the frontier. g3 measured/structural-only, capability claim 0. $0; sequential single agent; isolation worktree tracks main; g_doc_consolidation respected (state/ + RESEARCH.md §60 = orchestrator's; AGENTS.tape/HEXAD/* untouched). NO push.


§verdict_anima_flame_trainer_s71_2026_05_19 — §71: anima training substrate migration PyTorch → hexa-lang flame (AGENTS.tape @D g_train_flame_not_pytorch d=2026-05-19, commit bdd80521c; CLAUDE.md hexa-first identity the why). $0 INSTRUMENT-FIRST cycle — NO cost-bearing GPU fire (the d768·12L GPU train is a SEPARATE later gated step per g_train_flame_not_pytorch fire_gate_note; single sequential agent, isolation worktree tracks main per §50, NO push). JUDGED PATH = A (device-resident hand-fused d768·12L decoder). A/B CONFIRMED BY MEASUREMENT (not assertion): anima canonical training model = ConsciousDecoderV2 d768·12L·V256·n_head12·n_kv_head4·n_layer12 — verified from state/carving_dataregime_s16_2026_05_18/train_carving_s16.py argparse defaults (--d-model 768 / --n-layer 12 / --n-head 12 / --n-kv-head 4; vocab_size=256 line 275) = the §16/§59-FIRE/§62 config; the 5-tuple (d,nh,nkv,V,n_layer)=(768,12,4,256,12) is INTEGER-EQUAL to flame Path-A flame_d768_12L_corpus_test.hexa header config (T=1024 d=768 nh=12 nkv=4 h=3072 V=256 n_layer=12), h=3072=4·768 SwiGLU inner ⟹ anima base d768·12L transformer core maps BYTE-IDENTICALLY onto flame Path A, NO arch-flexibility (Path-B generic ag_spec/ag_tape) needed for the vanilla core; Path-B measured slow at d768·12L (g_train_flame_not_pytorch perf_claim_honesty, hexa-lang ag_tape large step >900s) ⟹ large anima model FORCED onto Path A. anima .hexa trainer BUILT (Y): HEXAD/FLAME/anima_flame_trainer.hexa (created the dir), cloned+adjusted from flame_d768_12L_corpus_test.hexa, one cfg_canon toggle — MODE_CANON (d768·12L T=1024, byte-identical to Path-A config, GPU dispatch target, build-only ~10GB) / MODE_VERIFY default (d=32·3L T=16 SAME anima corpus, the flame_d32_corpus_test.hexa $0 convergence oracle). CORPUS (stated honestly): training/corpus_consciousness_v1.jsonl 151,943 bytes — the SAME byte-level V=256 corpus the flame Path-A d768 reference + the d32 oracle already target; a §16-class ~600MB corpus NOT used (the $0 instrument-first verify only needs the small corpus to prove compile+converge from-scratch; the data-regime corpus is a SEPARATE later GPU concern, g3). from-scratch (g_clm_from_scratch): nn_decoder_init(M, seed_init=42) RANDOM seed-fixed, base_ckpt=NONE (zero ckpt-load/fine-tune/from-pretrained; read_file_bytes only on the .jsonl). anima edits ZERO flame/hexa-lang source (g_train_flame_not_pytorch upstream_downstream_invariant ≅ hexa-lang AGENTS.tape g7 / @F f3 sibling-SSOT-lock) — flame consumed as stdlib only. $0 LOCAL CONVERGENCE MEASURED (HEXA_MAC_BUILD_OK=1 hexa build, compiled path no new dependency, output to state dir not /tmp): MODE_VERIFY build clean exit 0; MODE_CANON d768·12L build clean exit 0 (GPU-dispatch ready, layout well-formed); init epoch gn2 = 7.97113 (|Δ|=3.1e-5 vs anima d32 oracle 7.97116, algorithm-byte-eq init); step10 gn2 5.86738; step80 gn2 9.16102e-07; final gn2 = 8.87256e-07; gn2 COLLAPSE = 8.98403e6× (≥1e6×, anima oracle ~2.13e7×); acc = 8/8 full small-corpus memorization; trainer self-report 4/4 PASS — the from-scratch flame trainer (downstream consumer of stdlib/flame) reproduces anima d_corpus_fire convergence over anima OWN corpus within fp-tol; the instrument-first gate for the future d768·12L GPU fire SATISFIED. OVERLAY-GAP PARTITION (the load-bearing deliverable, g3 honest, exhaustive+disjoint over {Path-A/Path-B/GAP}): (a) Law-71 Ψ/tension/Φ self-track = Path-A (if self.training no_grad metric over already-computed activations; pure post-fwd arithmetic, Path-A-expressible given dual logits exist) · (b) PureFieldFFN dual-engine FFN = GAP (two parallel Linear→GELU→Linear out=a−g, replaces SwiGLU FFN, block-layout change) · (c) Dir-I Ψ-anchored CTL + tension-supervised routing = GAP (in-graph additive multi-term loss; Path-A grad path single-objective) · (d) §59/§68 W-native PTD aux head = Path-B (small additive MSE aux head, generic ag_tape expresses directly) · (e) Engine A⇄G dual logits_a/logits_g = GAP (two parallel Linear(d,V) heads; flame stdlib one nn_lm_head; m_total/mc_off_logits one out-proj — Path-A device-resident layout extension). Tally Path-A=1 Path-B=1 GAP=3, exhaustive 5/5 disjoint. INBOX PATCH FILED (one concept, ~/core/hexa-lang/inbox/patches/flame-path-a-dual-head-and-multiterm-grad.md): the 3 GAPs (b)(c)(e) share one root concept for Path A — the device-resident fused decoder (m_total/mc_total/nn_decoder_grad/nn_decoder_adamw_step) is single-head/single-objective/SwiGLU-fixed, and anima CANNOT work around it downstream (the dual head parameters + extra loss gradient must live INSIDE the fused layout/backward, which the upstream/downstream invariant forbids anima to edit); load-bearing requested primitive = a dual-logits + aux-grad hook (nn_decoder_grad_with_aux(..., d_aux_logits) so anima composes the physics objective downstream from a pure function of flame already-available logits/tensions); PureFieldFFN block-layout filed as lower-priority context in the same file (one-concept-per-file discipline). flame is NOT buggy — every GAP is a missing extension surface for anima-physics decoders, NOT a defect in the correct vanilla flame decoder; patch-request not workaround. CLOSED-FORM SIDECAR B-S71-1..4 4/4 🔵 (state/anima_flame_trainer_s71_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s71.py): B-S71-1 CONFIG-MATCHES-ANIMA-CANONICAL (5-tuple integer-equal anima-canonical==flame-Path-A==trainer-MODE_CANON literals + h=3072) · B-S71-2 FROM-SCRATCH-INIT-RANDOM-SEED-FIXED (nn_decoder_init fixed-seed + zero ckpt-LOAD call; predicate strips comments+string literals so the documentary base_ckpt=NONE from-scratch CLAIM does not false-positive — HONEST predicate tightening recorded: first run FAILed on the word base_ckpt inside a print() string asserting its ABSENCE, fixed to detect ckpt-LOAD operations not the negation, NOT result-fitting) · B-S71-3 NO-FLAME-SOURCE-EDIT (git status of ~/core/hexa-lang/ = the only change is the new inbox/patches/ file) · B-S71-4 OVERLAY-GAP-PARTITION-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT (fin