  emission_onset_transition_class_verdict = "**PRIMARY = (a) Hopf bifurcation** (stable fixed point=think-only rest → stable limit cycle=sustained spontaneous-emission regime; control parameter=tension; order parameter=emission rate; predicted signature amplitude ~ sqrt(tension−tension_crit)). **discrete-substrate realization = (b) saddle-node/SNIC** (each single emission = excitable transient spike past a tunable threshold; §73/§75-FIRE controller boundary `tension_ema+λ·tension_std` IS such a saddle-node threshold). (a)+(b) NOT in conflict — arxiv:1905.01329 가 Hopf-class transition 이 discrete/piecewise-smooth substrate 에서 survive 함을 보임; excitable system 은 oscillatory regime 한 bifurcation 아래; 반복 tension build-up + saddle-node spike = relaxation-oscillation limit cycle 의 discrete analog (FitzHugh-Nagumo). REJECTED: (c) symmetry breaking = WHICH anchor routes (§16) frame 이지 WHETHER speak 아님 · (d) SOC avalanche = emission-interval statistics 의 measurement hypothesis, downstream (§32-§43 이 routing=SGD-lottery NOT power-law 입증) · (e) edge of chaos = regime LOCATION 이지 transition CLASS 아님 (complementary qualifier)."
