ime{Q5/E15/S0} interval_var 0.515306 §9-body 15/15 maj_frac 0.75 split False · cell1 setpoint-emit-only E_mean 0.156425 {Q5/E15/S0} iv 0.204082 15/15 0.75 False · cell2 setpoint-split-only E_mean 0.149851 {Q19/E0/S1} iv 0.0 1/1 0.95 True · cell3 full-unified-3regime E_mean 0.151309 {Q3/E16/S1} iv 0.109375 17/17 0.80 True · cell4 s85-hopf-overlay E_mean 0.147632 {Q7/E11/S2} iv 0.75 13/13 0.55 True (hopf_order_mean 0.027021). verdict_overall = DIRECTIONAL-POSITIVE-DESIGN. 4-corner verdict (g3 — measured, NOT pre-loaded): (α) UNIFIED-DRIVE-WELL-FORMED True (cell3 full-unified exercises all 3 regimes Q3/E16/S1 from single scalar E, runtime partition sums exactly N_STEPS) · (β) REGIME-DIFFERENTIAL True (cell3 {3,16,1} differs from cell1 emit-only {5,15,0} AND cell2 split-only {19,0,1} — unified 3-regime drive not reducible to either separated mechanism) · (γ) HOPF-OVERLAY-ADDS True (cell4 Hopf order-param mean 0.027>0, emission-onset trackable as control-param crossing, cell4 maj_frac 0.55 lowest = most regime-diverse) · (δ) SET-POINT-vs-§24-DECISION-CONSISTENT True (EMIT regime E≥θ_low ⊆ §24 talker_should_emit E≥θ_low by construction, SPLIT E≥θ_high ⊆ §24 since θ_high>θ_low, runtime s24_consistency True all 5 cells). §7 GOAL-legitimacy 3/3 PASS: ① not-generic-LM-pretrain ✓ (anima own set-point + MITOSIS + Ψ) · ② not-generic-then-graft ✓ (zero external classifier/LLM/generic-RAG, closed-form set-point error only, AST-audited) · ③ anima-physics-as-source ✓ (E = deviation norm over Law-71 Ψ/tension/Φ byte-equal formula; SAPIN active inference = honest direction-anchor NOT capability proof). closed side B-S86-1..7 7/7 🔵 sidecar (state/homeostatic_setpoint_mitosis_s86_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s86.py — central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff verified): B-S86-1 SET-POINT-ERROR-NONNEGATIVE (E weighted-L2-norm radicand ≥0 sympy nonnegative under pos-weight assumptions, E=0 iff zero-deviation witness, E>0 positive witness) · B-S86-2 REGIME-PARTIT