§verdict_axolotl_neoteny_antisaturation_s87f2_2026_05_19 — §87-F2 AXOLOTL NEOTENY ANTI-SATURATION design + $0 Mac CPU stub smoke. First time anima USES frog/amphibian biology in its architecture (vs read-only — §80 biology deep research had an amphibian subsection anima never applied). $0 — NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, sequential single agent. **Core insight (g3 over-claim 0)**: axolotl (Mexican salamander) = neoteny — stays a juvenile/larval/plastic form for life, never metamorphoses into a mature adult, keeping lifelong regeneration + neural plasticity. anima §16.6-C memorization-saturation is the OPPOSITE — anima training over-matures into a frozen byte-cascade attractor (§16 final CE ≈0.0045; §59-FIRE/§73-FIRE/§82-FIRE/§83-FIRE all measured trained-saturated). §1.1 data-regime irreducibility, this angle = anima becomes an "adult" too fast, loses plasticity. F-2 = neoteny-inspired ANTI-SATURATION: keep anima in a plastic juvenile regime so saturation is slowed/blocked, directly targeting the §16.6-C ceiling. **Maturity 3-proxy metric**: maturity ∈ [0,1] = W_CE·m1 + W_MAJ·m2 + W_D·m3 (0.40/0.35/0.25, convex combination) — M-1 CE-floor proximity (CE→0 over-mature, §16 0.0045 nearly frozen) · M-2 attractor-basin depth (byte-cascade maj_frac→1.0) · M-3 gradient-field effective dimensionality D collapse (§84 grokking-collapse anchor). neoteny N = 1−maturity (higher = more plastic juvenile). **4 NK anti-saturation mechanisms, each distinct maturity axis**: NK-1 CE-floor clamp (CE ≥ θ_floor, M-1) · NK-2 plasticity-reinjection (saturation-triggered TARGETED controlled perturbation shallowing the basin + lifting D — axolotl regeneration mirror, explicitly distinct from §81 raw unconditional noise: NK-2 is saturation-triggered + targeted, M-2) · NK-3 dimensionality-floor (D ≥ θ_D, M-3) · NK-4 metamorphosis-block (dynamic saturation-triggered hold in juvenile regime — distinct from fixed-budget early-stopping, global maturation rate). **5-cell stub grid (deterministic LCG seed 1337, N=60 steps)**: cell0_baseline none — final maturity 0.9969 / neoteny 0.0031 / NK fired — / sat-delay step 10 · cell1_floor_clamps NK-1+NK-3 — maturity 0.9416 / N 0.0584 / NK-1,NK-3 / step 10 · cell2_reinjection NK-2 — maturity 0.6232 / N 0.3768 / NK-2 / step 60 (no cross) · cell3_metamorph_block NK-4 — maturity 0.7092 / N 0.2908 / NK-4 / step 10 · cell4_full_neoteny NK-1+2+3+4 — maturity 0.6770 / N 0.3230 / NK-1,NK-2 / step 60 (no cross). **4-corner verdict (measured, NOT pre-loaded)**: (α) NEOTENY-METRIC-WELL-FORMED True (N = 1−maturity ∈ [0,1] every cell, maturity convex 3-proxy combo) · (β) ANTI-SATURATION-DIFFERENTIAL True (cell4 N 0.323 ≫ cell0 0.003, cell4 never crosses SAT_TRIGGER 0.70 = saturation delayed) · (γ) NK-MECHANISM-DIFFERENTIAL True (3 single-NK cells pairwise-distinct final-state signatures) · (δ) §16.6-C-CONNECTION True (baseline reproduces §16.6-C saturation maturity 0.997 / maj 0.993 / D 1.61, neoteny reduces all three) → **overall DIRECTIONAL-POSITIVE** (β ∧ γ). **closed B-S87F2-1..6 6/6 🔵** (sidecar state/axolotl_neoteny_antisaturation_s87f2_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s87f2.py, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py sha c93e160a 0-line-diff): B-S87F2-1 MATURITY-PROXY-BOUNDED (maturity convex combo of 3 [0,1] proxies ⇒ [0,1], N = 1−maturity ∈ [0,1], sympy corners + numeric) · B-S87F2-2 NK-MECHANISM-PARTITION (NK-1..4 distinct maturity axes, 3 single-NK cells pairwise-distinct signatures, all differ from baseline, AST 4-branch presence) · B-S87F2-3 ANTI-SATURATION-MONOTONE (neoteny ON ⇒ maturity non-increasing + delay non-decreasing numeric; NK-1 CE-clamp strictly lowers m1, sympy ∂m1/∂ce = −1/(init−floor) < 0) · B-S87F2-4 §16.6-C-CONNECTION 연결부위 (baseline reproduces §16.6-C saturation, neoteny reduces all 3 proxies, CE floor anchored to §16 0.0045, maturity_score reads ce+maj+D proxy triple, structural+AST) · B-S87F2-5 §11-B-CE-BASE-PRESERVED 연결부위 (NK are CE-base overlays clamp/modulate the CE curve, NOT no-CE phy