ics-state 를 거의 정지시킴이 §83-FIRE + §88-S86 양쪽에서 일관. B-S88S86 8/8 🔵 sidecar (SET-POINT-ERROR-NONNEGATIVE · REGIME-PARTITION-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT · §24-DECISION-CONSISTENCY 연결부위 · MITOSIS-HOOK-CONNECTION 연결부위 · §85-HOPF-CONTROL-PARAM-MAPPING · §9-METRIC-REUSE · §86-STUB-CONNECTION AST · DETERMINISTIC). B-S88S86-NOTE empirical carve-out (trained-scale OUTCOME = SGD/measurement empirical, B-D-NOTE/B-S83-FIRE-NOTE family, NOT counted 🔵). central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py sha c93e160a 0-line-diff (sidecar-only). agent rate-limited mid-monitor — dispatch nohup self-managed fire + result pull; post-fire orchestrator reconstruct (state dir agent-worktree → main copy, g6 verdict append). g3: necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7), capability claim 0, SAPIN biology honest direction-anchor, design-level unification trained-scale 에서 degenerate — trained-scale ≠ GOAL emergence. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달.

§verdict_axolotl_neoteny_fire_s88f2_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §88-F2 AXOLOTL NEOTENY ANTI-SATURATION TRAINED-SCALE fire. §87-F2 design-tier (commit 798b6110d, B-S87F2 6/6 🔵) 의 trained-scale 검증 — §80 biology(amphibian) anima-mapping, axolotl neoteny (평생 juvenile/plastic) 를 anima §16.6-C memorization-saturation anti-mechanism 으로. §88 trio 중 §1.1 data-regime irreducibility 를 정면 표적하는 유일 후보 — §81/§82/§83-FIRE 가 trained-saturated ckpt 위 overlay 라 collapse 한 것과 결정적으로 다름 (§88-F2 는 학습-시 anti-saturation, trained-saturated 가 아니라 non-saturated ckpt 를 만드는 게 목표). runpod A100-SXM4 pod (1st e0muaeaihfx0sc terminated → 2nd vydide8snncs1i, dispatch retry), SSH-robust podHostId-fixed dispatch, self-managing nohup. §16-class ConsciousDecoderV2 d768·12L·283.72M from-scratch seed 1337, 1500 step. 3-cell (cell0 baseline normal training / cell1 full-neoteny NK-1..4 / cell2 neoteny+§24 emission probe). **결과 (g3 measured)**: cell0 baseline final_ce 0.0038 (trained-saturated, over-mature) · attractor maj_frac 0.872 (byte-cascade attractor 강) · maturity 0.9496 · effective D 1.89. cell1/cell2 neoteny final_ce **0.0413 (10× higher = over-fit 안 함, juvenile 유지)** · attractor maj_frac **0.350 (0.872 → 0.35, byte-cascade attractor 半減)** · maturity **0.7478 < baseline 0.9496** · effective D **2.70 > baseline 1.89 (collapsed 덜 됨)**. **4-corner**: α NEOTENY-DELAYS-SATURATION-AT-TRAINED **True** (neoteny arm 이 maturity·attractor·CE-floor·D 4 지표 전부에서 baseline 보다 less-saturated — saturation 실제 지연 measured) · β NEOTENY-UNDERTRAINS False (학습 자체는 됨 — CE descent 일어남, §11-B no-CE degenerate 아님) · γ JUVENILE-BUT-COMPETENT **False** (saturation 늦췄으나 body §9-coherent count 0 — juvenile-but-competent 완전 regime 미도달) · δ NEOTENY-NO-EFFECT False (효과 분명히 있음). **verdict (α) NEOTENY-DELAYS-SATURATION-AT-TRAINED**: §88 trio 중 첫 measured-positive — neoteny anti-saturation 이 trained-scale 에서 §16.6-C memorization-saturation 을 measurably 지연 (maturity 0.95→0.75, byte-cascade attractor 0.87→0.35, D 1.89→2.70). **단 γ=False — saturation delay ≠ juvenile-but-competent ≠ GOAL emergence**: anti-saturation 은 mechanism 으로 작동하나 coherent juvenile competence 는 아직 미발현 (body §9-coherent 0). directional-positive, NOT GOAL emergence (B-EMERGE-7). honest 의의 — §81/§82/§83-FIRE + §88-F1/§88-S86 가 모두 trained-saturated ψ 위 overlay collapse/degenerate 였던 것과 달리, §88-F2 는 학습-시 anti-saturation 으로 *trained-saturation 자체를 늦춤* — §1.1 data-regime irreducibility 의 root (over-mature memorization) 를 직접 movement 시킨 첫 trained-scale 측정. 단 saturation 지연만으로 emergence 안 옴 (γ False) — non-saturated regime 이 coherent emission 으로 이어지려면 추가 path 필요. B-S88F2 7/7 🔵 sidecar (MATURITY-PROXY-BOUNDED · NK-MECHANISM-IN-TRAINING-LOOP AST · ANTI-SATURATION-MONOTONE · §16.6-C-CONNECTION 연결부위 · §11-B-CE-BASE-PRESERVED · §87-F2-STUB-CONNECTION AST · DETERMINISTIC). B-S88F2-NOTE empirical carve-out (trained-scale OUTCOME = SGD/measurement empirical, B-D-NOTE/B-SCALE-NOTE family, NOT counted 🔵). central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py sha c93e160a 0-line-diff (sidecar-only). agent rate-limited mid-monitor — dispatch nohup self-managed (1st pod retry → 2nd pod), result pull; post-fire orchestrator commit + g6 verdict reconstruct. g3: necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7), capability claim 0, axolotl neoteny biology honest direction-anchor, saturation-delay ≠ GOAL emergence. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. **§88 trained-scale trio 결산 (§88-F2 + §88-F1 + §88-S86)**: §87-F2/§87-F1/§86 design-tier 3 후보 trained-scale 검증 — §88-F2 axolotl neoteny **(α) NEOTENY-DELAYS-SATURATION measured-positive** (단 γ juvenile-but-competent False) · §88-F1 frog-eye salience (mixed) PARTIAL (4-corner all False) · §88-S86 SAPIN set-point (β-mixed) PARTIAL-COLLAPSE (E near-constant degenerate). 3 중 §88-F2 만 directional-positive — §1.1 root (memorization-saturation) 를 정면 표적한 유일 design 이 유일하게 trained-scale movement 보임. §88-F1/§88-S86 = trained-saturated ψ near-constant 문제로 design-tier well-formed → trained-scale degenerate (§83-FIRE 동형). honest 종합: anti-saturation (학습-시 개입) 이 trained-saturated overlay 보다 §1.1 에 유효, 단 saturation-delay 자체는 GOAL emergence 아님 — 다음 path = neoteny non-saturated regime + coherent emission 연결.

