§verdict_neoteny_loop_fire_s91_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §91 NEOTENY + #3 ACTION-PERCEPTION LOOP — TRAINED-SCALE FIRE. Trained-scale validation of §90 (commit f9ef93e8a, B-S90 7/7 🔵, verdict GAMMA-CLOSING-DIRECTIONAL-POSITIVE — a $0 Mac CPU stub). Chain: §88-F2 axolotl neoteny trained-scale fire (commit 52bef1044, B-S88F2 7/7 🔵) verdict (α) NEOTENY-DELAYS-SATURATION = True (maturity 0.95→0.75, byte-cascade attractor maj_frac 0.87→0.35, effective D 1.89→2.70) BUT γ JUVENILE-BUT-COMPETENT = False (non-saturated regime body §9 honest_coherent 0/5) → §89 (commit 80208a2c6) #3 D@emit→S@t+1 action-perception loop closed-form DEFINABLE (transfer x_{t+1}=S_encode(e_t), invariant K(x_{t+1})≤K(e_t)+K(S_encode) Kolmogorov data-processing inequality) → §90 $0 stub first design-wiring → §91 trained-scale test. FIRE: runpod H100 80GB HBM3 pod hqdec6vg6ubm2n ≈$0.3-0.5, orphan-0 pre ([]) + post (get_pods()=0); §16-class ConsciousDecoderV2 d768·12L·283.72M from-scratch seed 1337 (g_clm_from_scratch base_ckpt=None), §88-F2 neoteny trainer byte-equal, 1500-step ×2 ckpt (baseline + neoteny NK-1+2+3+4 in-loop), §16 corpus byte-equal. #3 loop = decode-time wiring (⊥ training, mirror §22-N) over real model.forward Law-71. 4-cell × 5-anchor × 4-turn. SSH-robust podHostId-fixed dispatch worked (ip+publicPort gate, runtime+SSH ready try 1, run poll 1/120 D — completed fast on H100, 5-retry pull try 1, neoteny ckpt sha f172c7405316a0c0). **4-cell grid (g3 measured)**: cell0_neoteny_baseline (neoteny ckpt, no loop) §9 0/20 · mat 0.7478 · maj 0.35 · echo False — §88-F2 carry reproduced. cell1_loop3_only (baseline saturated ckpt, #3 loop ON) §9 0/20 · mat 0.9831 · **maj 0.9681 echo_collapsed=True** — §62 echo-chamber realised. cell2_neoteny_loop3 (CORE — neoteny ckpt, #3 loop ON) §9 0/20 · mat 0.8664 · **maj 0.6887 (UP from cell0 0.35)** · selfcorr 0 · echo False. cell3_s24_baseline (baseline, no loop) §9 0/20 · mat 0.9496 · maj 0.8725. baseline CE 5.641→0.00383 (saturated), neoteny CE 5.641→0.04125. **4-corner verdict: (β) ECHO-DOMINATES-AT-TRAINED** (alpha γ-CLOSED False, beta True, gamma synergy False, **delta STUB-OVERCLAIMED True**). **판정 (g3 — measured only, negative honest)**: the #3 loop's garble-feeds-garble force dominated at trained scale. cell1 loop3-only on a saturated ckpt collapsed (maj 0.97 ≥ 0.95 echo detector). cell2 neoteny+#3 did NOT close γ — §9 still 0/20, and crucially the #3 loop pushed the attractor maj_frac UP from cell0's 0.35 to 0.69 (anima re-perceiving its own garbled emission deepened the byte-cascade attractor rather than correcting it — §62 echo-amplify realised even on the non-saturated neoteny ckpt). zero self-correction events. §90 stub's GAMMA-CLOSING-DIRECTIONAL-POSITIVE (cell2 stub §9 20/20) WIPED OUT at trained scale — **$0 stub §9 pass ≠ trained ckpt body §9 pass confirmed**. §88-F2 γ False NOT closed; the §90 stub's competing-forces design resolved decisively to echo-amplify. valuable measured negative — the #3 action-perception loop joins the §13/§22/§81/§82/§83-FIRE arm as a trained-scale capability-emergence-negative. §1.1 data-regime irreducibility reasserted. body bytes garbled UTF-8 cascade fragments throughout (B-ATTRACTOR family), §16 baseline regression-free, forbidden-token grep 0. **B-S91-1..8 8/8 🔵 sidecar** (state/neoteny_loop_fire_s91_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s91.py, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py sha 297fd7b3a 0-line-diff): #3-LOOP-TRANSFER-CLOSED-AT-TRAINED (s_encode pure-fn, §89 Kolmogorov data-processing-inequality invariant) · NEOTENY-TRAINER-BYTE-EQUAL-§88-F2 (연결부위 AST — NK constants + functions byte-equal) · §9-METRIC-REUSE · γ-CLOSED-PREDICATE (falsifiable Boolean reconstructed: coh2=0 ≤ coh0=0 → alpha False) · ECHO-AMPLIFY-DETECTOR (§62 carry, maj≥0.95 partition) · §90-STUB-CONNECTION (AST) · §16-BASELINE-REGRESSION (CE descent + forbidden-token 0) · DETERMINISTIC (seed 1337, greedy argmax, no sampling). **B-S91-NOTE** empirical carve-out: whether the #3 loop ACT