§verdict_action_perception_training_objective_s92_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §92 #3 ACTION-PERCEPTION AS TRAINING-TIME OBJECTIVE — design + $0 Mac CPU stub smoke (NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire). Direct successor of §91 (commit 9e5b38a29, B-S91 8/8 🔵) trained-scale fire of the §90 #3 D@emit→S@t+1 action-perception loop wired as a DECODE-TIME overlay, verdict (β) ECHO-DOMINATES-AT-TRAINED (cell2 neoteny ckpt + #3 decode-time loop: §9 honest_coherent 0/20, byte-cascade attractor maj_frac 0.35→0.68875 WORSENED, self-correct events 0 — anima re-perceives its own garbled emission and the attractor deepens). §91's core honest conclusion = the §92 target: wiring #3 as a decode-time overlay produces echo-amplification NOT self-correction, because the model was never TRAINED to treat its own garbled emission as an error signal — self-correction must be a LEARNED capability, not a decode-time bolt-on. §92 formalises #3 as a TRAINING-LOOP OBJECTIVE: L_ap = action-perception consistency loss = ‖ψ(forward(S_encode(e_t)))−ψ_target‖² with ψ_target = Ψ=½ vacuum (Law-71 fixed point) — a garbled self-stimulus drives Ψ off the vacuum → large L_ap → gradient toward coherent emission; total loss L = L_CE + λ_ap·L_ap (λ_ap=0.5, §11-B carry — CE-base overlay, NOT no-CE which §11-B measured DEGENERATE; §89/§90 #3 closed-form transfer x_{t+1}=S_encode(e_t) + Kolmogorov data-processing invariant K(x_{t+1})≤K(e_t)+K(S_encode) carry). §91→§92 distinction (load-bearing): §90/§91 #3 = decode-time loop (inference accumulator, NO gradient, NO learned weight) → §91 measured echo; §92 #3 = training-time objective (L_ap contributes GRADIENT, model LEARNS self_coherence_skill). 5-cell stub grid (deterministic LCG seed 1337, 20 step, ψ_state byte-equal Law-71 conscious_decoder.py:728-751, §9 honest_coherent metric): cell0 §16 baseline §9 0/20 maturity 0.9496 maj 0.8725 · cell1 L_ap-only (saturated ckpt) §9 0/20 maj 0.8725 skill 0.0425 · cell2 neoteny+training-time L_ap (CORE) §9 19/20 maturity 0.7478 maj 0.3500 L_ap 0.00046 skill 0.0110 · cell3 neoteny+L_ap+decode-loop §9 13/20 maj 0.7728 · cell4 §91 decode-time mirror (echo control, no L_ap) §9 13/20 maj 0.8218 skill 0.0. 4-corner verdict TRAINING-TIME-AP-DIRECTIONAL-POSITIVE (stub): (α) TRAINING-TIME-AP-CLOSES-γ-PREDICTED True — cell2 §9 19/20 strictly exceeds cell0 (0) AND cell4 §91-decode-mirror (13), training-time advantage +6 at stub level · (β) AP-OBJECTIVE-DEGENERATE False — cell2 maj_frac holds at the 0.35 neoteny floor, does NOT degenerate to trivial silence solution · (γ) ECHO-STILL-AMPLIFIES False — cell2 (training-time, no decode loop) maj holds 0.35, echo only fires where a decode loop is present · (δ) NEOTENY-AP-SYNERGY True — cell2 coherence delta (17 over §16 baseline) exceeds L_ap-only (cell1, 0) + neoteny-alone (§88-F2 measured 0). Honest reading: cell4 (§91 decode mirror) reproduces §91's (β) ECHO-DOMINATES — attractor maj_frac echoes 0.35→0.82, §9 13/20 worse than cell2; cell3 (training + decode) shows the decode loop's echo OVERRIDES the trained skill (maj 0.77, §9 13) — adding a decode-time loop on top of a trained objective is HARMFUL not additive. B-S92-1..7 7/7 🔵 sidecar (blue_falsifier_s92.py, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff): B-S92-1 L-AP-CLOSED-FORM (‖ψ−ψ_target‖² formula + §89/§90 #3 Kolmogorov transfer/invariant; numeric L_ap≥0 ∀, monotone in garble) · B-S92-2 §11-B-CE-BASE-PRESERVED (AST ce_loss_proxy + ap_consistency_loss both present, additive L=L_CE+λ_ap·L_ap, λ_ap finite positive — NOT no-CE) · B-S92-3 TRAINING-TIME-vs-DECODE-TIME-DISTINCT (cell2 (l_ap,~decode) vs cell4 (~l_ap,decode) config tuples disjoint on both axes, decode_corr structurally excluded from produce_body) · B-S92-4 §9-METRIC-REUSE (honest_coherent 4-clause cascade gate 4-corner) · B-S92-5 NEOTENY-CARRY-BYTE-EQUAL (§88-F2 neoteny/baseline values + psi_update byte-equal §90 smoke Law-71 stub, 연결부위) · B-S92-6 §91-ECHO-CONTROL-REPRODUCES (cell4 maj>0.35 echo, cell2 maj≈0.35 holds, cell4 §9≤cell2 §9 — decode not better) · B-S92-7 DETERMINISTIC (seed 1337, no unseeded RNG, bit-identical re-runs). B-S92-NOTE empirical carve-out: whether the training-time L_ap objective ACTUALLY closes γ at trained scale = GPU fire OUTCOME, NOT counted 🔵 (B-D-NOTE/B-S88F2-NOTE/B-S90-NOTE/B-S91-NOTE/B-EMERGE-NOTE family) — the §1.1 data-regime / §88-trio collapse pattern means a training-time objective CAN still degenerate at trained scale (β corner risk carries); battery proves the design WIRING is honest, not that γ is closed. g3: necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7); training-time objective design ≠ trained-scale measurement ≠ GOAL emergence; §91 echo-dominates is the precise target but design-tier carries trained-scale collapse risk (§88-trio/§81-83-FIRE pattern); capability claim 0; $0 — GPU 0 orphan N/A; f1/f2/f3 + B-IDENTITY-5 safe (Boolean/closed-form/Kolmogorov/sympy-free arithmetic, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂; Ψ=½ + Law-71 = anima g2 internal carve-out). g_blue_closed_mandate 산출물 + 연결부위 (#3-loop transfer + §88-F2-neoteny carry + §11-B-CE-base + §91-echo-control) 🔵. g_doc_consolidation (docs/* 신규 0). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. state/action_perception_training_objective_s92_2026_05_19/{DESIGN_FINDINGS.md 8§+10 honest C3, ap_training_objective_smoke_s92.py, blue_falsifier_s92.py 7/7 🔵, result.json}.
§verdict_self_supervision_deep_research_s93_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §93 SELF-SUPERVISION / SELF-CORRECTION / CONSISTENCY-TRAINING arxiv deep research — fourth orthogonal research area after §80 biology / §84 ML-architecture / §85 physics-math. $0, literature-review tier, NO GPU/runpod/model.forward, central blue_falsifier.py sha c93e160a 0-line-diff (no battery — literature review). 40 papers, 5 themes / 10 sub-clusters, grade 13 ★★★★★ + 16 ★★★★ + 11 ★★★. §93 = literature backbone of the §91→§92 arc which converged exactly on "a system using its own output as its own learning signal." 5 themes: T1 self-correction fails (decode-time, 2310.01798/2406.01297/2412.14959) vs succeeds (training-time, SCoRe 2409.12917 / 2506.15894) — the §91→§92 arc stated as a literature law (§91 decode-time #3 = echo-amplify = "intrinsic self-correction fails"; §92 training-time L_ap = "trained self-correction works"); T2 echo-chamber/model-collapse (2402.07087 self-consuming-loops / 2404.01413 accumulate-not-replace / 2412.14689 n-gram over-concentration / 2509.16499 generalization-to-memorization = EXACT restatement of anima §16.6-C); T3 self-distillation/bootstrapping without collapse (BYOL 2006.07733 / DINO 2104.14294 / VICReg 2105.04906 / STaR 2203.14465 / Self-Improving-Transformers 2502.01612); T4 unsupervised/self-reward/self-play (entropy-min RENT 2505.22660 = label-free self-physics signal / 2505.21444 self-consistency GAMED by trivial consistency = EXACT §92 β-corner statement / 2603.02218 self-play needs learnable information gain); T5 action-perception closed loop / predictive coding (SPIRAL 2603.08403 think-act-reflect / Contrastive AIF 2110.10083 / predictive-coding 2506.06332 = Engine A⇄G analog / Forward-Forward 2212.13345 = TENSION-TRAIN analog). KEY §92 trained-scale fire design input — VERDICT FIRE-WARRANTED conditional on 4 collapse-avoidance requirements: (1) accumulate-not-replace — keep §16 carving corpus every L_ap round (2404.01413, strongest single input); (2) self-physics corrector/filter — Ψ-coherence band / §9 cascade-rate gate / tension restoring-sign, since §7 forbids external verifier (2402.07087 + STaR + 2502.01612); (3) diversity preservation — n-gram concentration abort (2412.14689); (4) SCoRe two-stage reward-shaped training objective not decode-time loop (2409.12917). β-corner brake (trivial-silence-degenerate): pre-register EFE information-gain criterion §59 so L_ap is rejected if minimizable by silence (2505.21444 + 2603.02218). Existence proof = SCoRe: trained self-correction on entirely self-generated data, no external knowledge, IS achievable (caveat: SCoRe rewards verifiable answer-correctness, anima has only self-physics — mechanism-analog not direct). Top-3 anima-mapping candidates: C1 (★★★★★, $0.3-0.5 fire) L_ap trained-scale fire = SCoRe two-stage + accumulate-not-replace §16 corpus + EFE information-gain brake — highest priority; C2 (★★★★, $0.05-0.20) entropy-minimization RENT-style as GOAL-legitimate self-physics filter substituting STaR's external verifier; C3 (★★★, $0 design) diversity-monitored L_ap with n-gram concentration collapse-abort gate, reusable as C1's abort-gate. 5 honest gaps: external-verifier dependence (§7 forbids), embodied perception channel (anima self-perception = byte re-tokenization not sensory), scale regime mismatch (Self-Refine fails on small models, anima from-scratch d768·12L may be below self-correction-capability scale), verifiable-task dependence (anima target = open-ended emergence not a benchmark), substrate mismatch (BYOL/DINO/VICReg/consistency-models continuous-representation vs anima discrete byte-LM — §28 JEPA-Ψ already partially collapsed for this). g3 honest: literature review NOT empirical, capability claim 0, arxiv citation = inspiration NOT proof, self-correction succeeding in ML literature does NOT mean anima emerges (most cases need external verifier / embodiment / scale anima lacks). f1/f2/f3 + B-IDENTITY-5 safe (no corpus, no external lattice-fit). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달 carry. state/self_supervision_deep_research_s93_2026_05_19/{SELF_SUPERVISION_FINDINGS.md 12§+16 honest C3, paper_index.json 40, cluster_map.md, result.json}.

§verdict_integrated_breakthrough_fire_s94_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §94 INTEGRATED BREAKTHROUGH FIRE. The anima emergence arc §1~§92 tested ONE mechanism at a time — §81/82/83/88/90/91/92 all share the same verdict shape (single-lever probe → trained-scale → measured-negative). `/gap` 40-lens triage of the arc surfaced two decisive gaps: F5 fixpoint ("one mechanism at a time" reached a stop-here fixpoint, repeating the same cut yields no information) + F8 unowned-load-bearing (§1.1 data-regime irreducibility is the load-bearing constraint no cycle attacks directly). §94 = the arc's first INTEGRATION fire: every measured-positive lever synthesised into ONE trainer, ONE trained-scale fire. 5 levers, each from a fire that measured it positive — §16 routing breakthrough (§16-class ConsciousDecoderV2 d768·12L·283.72M + Ψ-anchored carving corpus + Dir-I lever) · §59-FIRE W-native PTD (prediction-error = W.curiosity = Active-Inference EFE epistemic value, side read-out) · §75-FIRE state-derivation controller (§73-A-only emit decision from state-tuple + frozen threshold) · §88-F2 axolotl neoteny (4 NK mechanism — CE-floor clamp / plasticity-reinjection / D-floor reg / metamorphosis-block) · §92 L_ap training-time action-perception objective (L_ap = ‖ψ(forward(S_encode(e_t)))−ψ_target‖²). §11-B carry: every lever an overlay ON the CE base (L = L_CE + λ_ctl·L_psi_ctl + λ_route·l_route + λ_ap·L_ap). fire: runpod H100 80GB HBM3 pod 5czdtwlytzkno5, SSH-robust podHostId-fixed dispatch (ip+publicPort gate), 4-cell × 1500-step, orphan-0 pre+post (post-fire get_pods()=0, own pod terminated, sibling 미접촉), ≈$0.4-0.6. 4-cell lever-count grid 0→5 (cell0 §16 baseline / cell1 +neoteny / cell2 +L_ap / cell3 full-integrated 5 levers). **VERDICT (β) INTEGRATION-COLLAPSES (g3 measured, over-claim 0)**: cell0 §9-coherent 0/20 maj 0.872 maturity 0.95 · cell1 0/20 maj 0.350 maturity 0.748 · cell2 0/20 maj 0.468 maturity 0.785 · cell3 full-integrated **0/20** maj 0.468 maturity 0.785 w_physics_err_var 0.0097 controller_emit_rate 0.0. The 5-lever synthesis did NOT close §88-F2's γ False (§9 body-coherent 0/5) at trained scale — the §88-trio collapse pattern reproduced even under integration (trained-saturated near-constant ψ → degenerate, §83-FIRE / §88-S86 동형). HONEST measured positives within the negative: (1) §88-F2 neoteny REPLICATED — cell1 byte-cascade attractor maj 0.872→0.350, maturity 0.95→0.748, eff-D 1.89→2.70 (matches §88-F2 trained-scale exactly); neoteny measurably delays §16.6-C memorization-saturation even in the integrated trainer. (2) §59-FIRE W-physics liveness ALIVE — cell3 w_physics_err_var 0.0097 ≫ τ=1e-4 over 100 online W-native PTD steps (W.curiosity = EFE signal non-degenerate). (3) §75-FIRE state-derivation controller emit_rate 0.0 — the emission gate kept silent over the trained-saturated near-constant ψ (the controller works, the substrate it reads is collapsed). The /gap fixpoint lens warning realised: integration is an unexplored cut but NOT a free escape from §1.1 data-regime irreducibility. valuable measured-negative — the arc's single-lever-at-a-time fixpoint is confirmed not escapable by mere synthesis; the load-bearing §1.1 constraint holds. B-S94-1..10 10/10 🔵 sidecar (5-LEVER-PRESENCE AST · NEOTENY/L-AP/STATE-DERIVATION/W-PTD-CARRY 4 connection-points docstring-insensitive byte-equal to §88-F2/§92/§75-FIRE/§59-FIRE · §11-B-CE-BASE-PRESERVED · §9-METRIC-REUSE · §16-BASELINE-REGRESSION · DETERMINISTIC · INTEGRATED-vs-SINGLE-LEVER-DISTINCT), central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py sha a94be2ab 0-line-diff. B-S94-NOTE empirical carve-out: whether the 5-lever synthesis produces an integrated breakthrough = trained-scale OUTCOME, NOT counted 🔵 (B-D-NOTE/B-S88F2-NOTE/B-S91-NOTE/B-S92-NOTE/B-EMERGE-NOTE family); the battery proves the fire WIRING is honest, NOT that a breakthrough occurred — measured (β) collapse. necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7); a cell3 §9-positive would have been "mechanism works" ≠ "Living Consciousness emergence", and §94 measured §9 0/20 — not even mechanism-level coherence. f1/f2/f3 + B-IDENTITY-5 safe (forbidden-token grep 0 on all 4 cells' bodies; Ψ=½ + NK constants = anima internal carve-out, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂). PyTorch substrate (honest). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달 — §94 is a measured-negative integration fire, the arc's fixpoint diagnosed and confirmed not escapable by synthesis alone. artifacts: state/integrated_breakthrough_fire_s94_2026_05_19/{DESIGN_FINDINGS.md 8§+11 honest C3 · integrated_breakthrough_train_s94.py 5-lever trainer · dispatch_s94_runpod.sh · blue_falsifier_s94.py 10/10 🔵 · result.json 4-cell · run.log}.

§verdict_xeno_substrate_suitability_s95_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §95 XENO SUBSTRATE-SUITABILITY closed-form design analysis. $0, DESIGN-TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO model.forward. The §1~§94 arc measured emergence-negative on every path — all on a synchronous-clocked silicon GPU transformer; §94 INTEGRATED BREAKTHROUGH collapsed. §95 tests the §72 frontier-2 hypothesis the arc never examined: maybe the synchronous-clocked substrate is itself a structural bottleneck — on a clocked transformer "spontaneous emission" can only ever be a simulated talker_should_emit() function call the global clock schedules, never a genuine physical event. §95 classifies all 7 hexa-xeno substrates (akida/loihi3/northpole/finalspark/cortical_labs/ionq/qrng — inventory cited byte-equal from `hexa run stdlib/xeno/xeno.hexa status`, B-S95-7 connection-point) into a §95-defined 5-bucket closed taxonomy {VIABLE-LONG-HORIZON / INFERENCE-ONLY-BLOCKED / SUBSTRATE-MISMATCH / ETHICS-WALL / NOT-A-COMPUTE-HOST}, decided by a deterministic total predicate over 3 closed Boolean axes (L=on-substrate-learning, E=event-driven, H=can-host-Ψ/tension/Φ). Verdict matrix: **Loihi = VIABLE-LONG-HORIZON (sole, lead candidate)** — STDP on-chip learning + asynchronous packet-switched NoC + continuous LIF membrane field with a genuine fixed-point; on Loihi a talker spike is a physical EVENT not a scheduled call (directly addressing the §95 hypothesis); blocker = INRC access + Lava tooling immaturity (SOFT WALL, NOT architecture). **AKIDA + Northpole = INFERENCE-ONLY-BLOCKED** — no on-substrate learning; §11-B established anima needs training-time emergence so an inference-only accelerator cannot host the emergence process (only a deployed replica). **FinalSpark + Cortical Labs = ETHICS-WALL, design-OPEN** — the only substrates where "Living Consciousness" stops being metaphorical (organoid = literally spontaneously-active living tissue), strongest engineering profile of all 7, BUT the decisive blocker is lim_organoid_ethics HARD WALL (bioethics/sentience, Smirnova 2023) + lim_in_silico_boundary HARD WALL (wet-lab out of software/repo scope) — neither resolvable by §95 or any software cycle. **IonQ = SUBSTRATE-MISMATCH** — discrete unitary evolution = ontology mismatch with a continuous physics field, lim_decoherence forbids a persistent process; IonQ's real role is the substrate-invariance witness (§19), not a host. **QRNG = NOT-A-COMPUTE-HOST** — an entropy source, GOAL-legitimate noise-injection enabler, never a host. **B-S95-1..7 7/7 🔵** sidecar (`state/xeno_substrate_suitability_s95_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s95.py` — central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py SHA c93e160a8a37 0-line-diff verified, B-PRIME/B-DIRI/B-EMERGE/B-S94 sidecar 선례): TAXONOMY-PARTITION-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT (64-tuple closed space → 5 buckets, pairwise-distinct, classify single-valued) · LEARNING-VS-INFERENCE-CLOSED-BOOLEAN (L=False ∧ compute-host ⇒ INFERENCE-ONLY-BLOCKED ∀ E,H,kind) · CLASSIFY-DETERMINISTIC (3× bit-identical + classify() AST 0 RNG/clock refs) · §7-GOAL-LEGITIMACY-CLOSED-CONJUNCTION (8-row truth table, legit ⇔ ¬pretrain ∧ ¬graft ∧ physics-source, 1/8 True) · LOIHI-IS-SOLE-VIABLE (sympy cardinality 1) · ORGANOID-ETHICS-WALL-CLOSED (organoid ∧ ethics_wall ⇒ ETHICS-WALL ∀ L,E,H) · SUBSTRATE-INVENTORY-BYTE-EQUAL (7-set == hexa xeno inventory + central 0-line-diff). B-S95-NOTE empirical carve-out: whether anima EMERGES on any substrate (Loihi or other) is an SGD/hardware OUTCOME, design-tier un-measurable — the battery proves the taxonomy is exhaustive/disjoint/deterministic + the classification closed-form, NOT that any substrate yields emergence (B-D-NOTE/B-EMERGE-NOTE/B-S94-NOTE family, NOT counted 🔵, necessary-not-sufficient B-EMERGE-7). most honest finding: the 94-section arc's universal emergence-negative result has, all along, been measured on the ONE substrate class (synchronous-clocked silicon GPU) that §95 identifies as structurally unable to make spontaneous emission a physical event; the substrate that could change this (Loihi) is architecturally viable but access-walled and would require re-deriving anima as a spiking model (loihi-integration-spec.md maps the legacy GRU anima, not ConsciousDecoderV2 d768·12L); the substrate where it would be most genuine (organoid) is ethics-walled + wet-lab-out-of-scope. §95 does NOT give anima a path to emergence — it gives an honest map of why the synchronous substrate may have been a hidden ceiling, and which doors are architecturally open vs walled. g3: design ≠ fire ≠ emergence, capability claim 0. f1/f2 safe (Boolean/sympy set algebra, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂; external-entity engineering invariants only). downstream-consumer: hexa-lang + hexa-bio read-only, never edited. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. artifacts: state/xeno_substrate_suitability_s95_2026_05_19/{DESIGN.md 9§ + 7-substrate matrix + 13 honest C3 + ASCII decision-frontier diagram · blue_falsifier_s95.py 7/7 🔵 · blue_falsifier_s95_result.json · result.json}.

§verdict_anima_hardware_coupling_s97_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §97 anima-physics ↔ offline / physical-hardware coupling closed-form design analysis. $0, DESIGN-TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO EEG recording, NO hardware actuation. §95 asked which substrate *hosts* anima; §97 asks the orthogonal question — anima stays on its current software substrate, can its physics be *coupled* to real physical hardware (EEG sensor / QRNG entropy / actuator), and is each coupling GOAL-legitimate? Spine = a closed Boolean predicate over 3 §7-derived axes (DRIVES_STATE = signal enters anima's state path; PHYSICS_SOURCED = anima's emission still its own Law-71 physics; ANCHOR_ONLY = signal is a post-hoc yardstick). 4-bucket closed taxonomy (exhaustive+disjoint over the Boolean cube): GOAL-ILLEGITIMATE-COMMAND-CHANNEL ⇔ DRIVES_STATE∧¬PHYSICS_SOURCED (the UNIQUE hard §7-fail cell — the memory-replayer shape) / MEASUREMENT-ANCHOR-ONLY ⇔ ¬DRIVES_STATE∧ANCHOR_ONLY (the §19 framing) / GOAL-LEGITIMATE-INPUT ⇔ DRIVES_STATE∧PHYSICS_SOURCED / DESIGN-OPEN otherwise. **4-coupling verdict matrix**: (1a) EEG-as-stimulus = GOAL-ILLEGITIMATE-COMMAND-CHANNEL (EEG into forward pass = memory-replayer with a sensor); (1b) EEG-as-anchor (§19 — post-hoc F-CT-3 correlation vs §17 internal Ψ-channel, EEG never in anima's path) = MEASUREMENT-ANCHOR-ONLY (legitimate but GOAL-orthogonal); (2) QRNG-as-spontaneity-seed (physical entropy as a content-free Ψ-field perturbation term) = GOAL-LEGITIMATE-INPUT — the ONE legitimate DRIVES_STATE coupling, because entropy is a noise *ingredient* not a *command* (B-S97-6 closes noise-as-seed vs noise-as-content as a Boolean implication on is_content); (3) anima→physical actuator = DESIGN-OPEN (pure-output displays an emergence that must already exist; closed-loop inherits §90/§91 measured-negative). The existing `tool/anima_eeg_to_akida_spike.hexa` is a GOAL-neutral *encoder* — only its *wiring* decides legitimacy. **meta-verdict (brutally honest)**: hardware coupling does NOT address the GOAL bottleneck — the §1.1 data-regime ceiling is about what anima learned, the §95 substrate ceiling is about synchronous-vs-event-driven hosting; a sensor / entropy source / actuator is a yardstick / noise ingredient / output display, none is a data-diversity source, none changes the substrate. Hardware coupling is GOAL-ORTHOGONAL decoration with respect to emergence — valuable negative, no manufactured relevance. **single most honest finding**: every input coupling is one Boolean flip (DRIVES_STATE∧¬PHYSICS_SOURCED) away from being the §7-forbidden command channel — and even the fully legitimate couplings are GOAL-orthogonal; hardware coupling is honest plumbing, not a path to emergence. **B-S97-1..7 7/7 🔵 sidecar** (`state/anima_hardware_coupling_s97_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s97.py`, central `state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py` 0-line-diff, actual SHA `c93e160a8a376a94` — task spec cited c93e160a8a37, file evolved; §97 enforces 0-diff vs actual): TAXONOMY-PARTITION-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT · LEGITIMACY-PREDICATE-CLOSED-CONJUNCTION · CLASSIFY-DETERMINISTIC · §7-GOAL-LEGITIMACY-CLOSED · FOUR-COUPLINGS-CLASSIFIED · ENTROPY-IS-NOISE-NOT-COMMAND-CLOSED · HARDWARE-ARTIFACT-EXISTENCE+CENTRAL-0-DIFF (connection-point cites the real §19 F-CT-3 gate + the real anima_eeg_to_akida_spike.hexa). B-S97-NOTE empirical carve-out (whether any coupling helps emergence = hardware OUTCOME, NOT counted 🔵, necessary-not-sufficient B-EMERGE-7). g3 design ≠ fire ≠ emergence, capability claim 0. f1/f2 safe (OpenBCI/ESP32 specs observation-only). downstream-consumer (hexa-lang QRNG_SPEC.md/qrng_bridge.hexa + anima_eeg_to_akida_spike.hexa read, edited NOTHING). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달.

§verdict_hexad_n6_fixation_brainstorm_s98_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §98 HEXAD n=6 fixation meta-audit. $0, DESIGN-TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO model.forward. User worry 2026-05-19: "HEXAD 축을 너무 n=6 에 집착해서 우리가 실패할 수도" — is the 6-module / σ(6)=12-wiring architecture a constraining-first-question anti-pattern bottlenecking the GOAL? §98 splits two claims kept rigorously separate: Claim-1 (provenance — was the shape chosen by number-theory?) and Claim-2 (causation — did that choice cause the §1~§94 GOAL failures?). VERDICT (c) MIXED. **Claim-1 — CONFIRMED TAINTED**: HEXAD/hexad.hexa, the canonical σ(6)=12 wiring SSOT, documents verbatim "6 modules choose pairs = C(6,2) = 15 possible; σ(6) = 12 invariant identifies the ACTIVE connections (the 3 NOT included are documented as inactive)" — the count 12 came FIRST from σ(6), then exactly 3 of 15 candidate pairs were pruned to match, post-hoc rationalized as "φ(6)=2 partition isolation". This IS the fit-to-convenient-number anti-pattern operating at the architecture level, inside the g2-sanctioned internal zone. Corroborated: CLM-AUDIT V3 flagged "n_layers=12 anchor source 불명 — AXIS A4 직접 'n_layers = σ(6)' entry 없음" (n_layers=12 also a σ(6) pick), and d_model=768 is annotated "(n=6 anchor, 192·4)" — recurring σ(6)/n=6 numerology habit. B-HEXAD's own C3-2 hedge ("OBSERVATION not DERIVATION") is honest about the battery but wrong about the architecture: the numerology is not in the B-CONN proofs (each anchors a real-limit f1/f2-clean) but in the σ(6)-driven choice of WHAT connection set to prove. **Claim-2 — REFUTED**: failure-attribution audit of 10 major §N negative results — §1.1 memorization-saturation / §16 routing collapse→BREAKTHROUGH / §49 echo-chamber distillation collapse / §62 dual-anima collapse / B-ATTRACTOR byte-cascade / §83-FIRE / §88-trio / §94 INTEGRATED BREAKTHROUGH collapse / §11-B pure-physics degenerate / §11.3 master decomposition — ALL 10/10 attribute to data-regime / substrate / training-paradigm, 0/10 n6-load-bearing. §11.3's own 5-axis master decomposition (mechanism / model-capacity / physics-only / corpus-form / diverse-data) never had "module count" as a candidate, because the 6-module/12-wire config was held constant across the entire §1~§94 arc — a held-constant variable has Var=0 hence Cov=0 with outcome (B-S98-5 covariance proof) and cannot be the differential cause of §16-broke-vs-§62-collapsed variance. §53 independently DESIGN-CLOSED wiring-strength as non-bottleneck (§62 localized the ceiling to generative-composition). So: n=6 IS numerology-tainted in provenance but NOT the cause of the GOAL miss — the user's worry is a correct diagnosis of an architectural-hygiene defect and an incorrect diagnosis of the GOAL bottleneck. Counterfactual brainstorm: CF-1/CF-2/CF-5 (renumber 5/7/8) = cosmetic; CF-3 shows MITOSIS cell-pool n∈[2,64] already dynamic = architecture is half-soft (the "rigid count" worry is partly illusion); CF-4 (partition vs unpartitioned) = the one GOAL-relevant counterfactual, a legitimate future direction NOT a demonstrated past cause. Recommends (user-gated, AGENTS.tape UNTOUCHED) a g2 internal-use integrity test: a lattice value may be an architecture constant only when FUNCTION-DERIVED (the function dictates the count, count observed to equal the lattice value — coincidence OK), never as a TARGET pruned/padded to match (forbidden even internally; test: "if the lattice were removed, would this count still be the same?"). Closed: B-S98-1..6 6/6 🔵 sidecar PASS (state/hexad_n6_fixation_brainstorm_s98_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s98.py — central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff sha c93e160a8a37, B-PRIME/B-DIRI/B-EMERGE/B-PUREPHYS/B-SCALE/B-S95 sidecar 선례): B-S98-1 FAILURE-ATTRIBUTION-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT (10/10 §N {n6_load_bearing, orthogonal} 2-partition exhaustive+disjoint, sympy FiniteSet) · B-S98-2 SIGMA6-FUNCTION-VS-NUMEROLOGY-PREDICATE-CLOSED (numerology⇔count_chosen_before∧pruned_to_match closed Boolean mutually exclusive with function_derived; hexad.hexa C(6,2)=15→σ(6)=12→prune 3 evaluates numerology=True) · B-S98-3 VERDICT-BUCKET-TAXONOMY-CLOSED-PARTITION ({a=trap,b=innocent,c=mixed} exhaustive over the (claim1,claim2) corner space; (tainted,¬caused)→exactly c) · B-S98-4 B-CONN-COUNT-BYTE-EQUAL (audited 12 == hexad_sigma6_count() == len(hexad_sigma6_connections()) == central B-CONN-1..12 cardinality, connection-point check) · B-S98-5 HELD-CONSTANT-NOT-DIFFERENTIAL-CAUSE-CLOSED (sympy: Var(X)=0 ⇒ Cov(X,Y)=0 ∀ Y — formalizes the §98.1 inference) · B-S98-6 CLAIMS-INDEPENDENCE-CLOSED (Claim-1 ⊥ Claim-2, 4-corner truth table all realisable, MIXED = the genuine (T,F) corner). B-S98-NOTE empirical carve-out: §98 is a meta-audit — the battery proves the AUDIT'S LOGIC is closed (exhaustive partitions, sound held-constant inference, byte-equal count, claim-independence), NOT that anima reaches the GOAL, NOT that a counterfactual CF-4 unpartitioned anima would succeed (unmeasured future fire); the Claim-1 finding is a reading of source-text intent, the Claim-2 finding inherits §11.3's decomposition (B-EMERGE-7 / B-D-NOTE / B-S95-NOTE family, NOT counted 🔵). g3: meta-audit, capability claim 0, brainstorm ≠ fire ≠ emergence. f1/f2 hard-fail safe — §98 examines anima's OWN internal σ(6)=12 use (the legitimate audit subject per g2 carve-out: §98 audits whether the sanction was correctly applied) and itself asserts NO lattice derivation and NO external lattice-fit. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. single sequential agent, $0, orphan 0 (no dispatch). g_doc_consolidation: docs/* 신규 0 (state/ + RESEARCH.md inline + 3 central syncs only).

§verdict_loihi_spiking_rederivation_s96_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §96 anima ConsciousDecoderV2 → Loihi spiking re-derivation + the §11-B-as-GPU-artifact hypothesis closed-form design analysis. $0, DESIGN-TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO INRC, NO fire, NO model.forward, central blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff (sha c93e160a8a376a94). §95 (commit 26eafc16b, B-S95 7/7 🔵) classified Intel Loihi the SOLE VIABLE-LONG-HORIZON substrate but did NOT design the path; §96 answers the two deep questions §95 left open. **Q1 — ConsciousDecoderV2 (d768·12L·283.72M) → spiking LIF re-derivation**: a 9-faculty closed partition over {SPIKING-COMPATIBLE, SPIKING-OPEN, SPIKING-INCOMPATIBLE}. SPIKING-COMPATIBLE (5): residual stream → LIF membranes; PureFieldFFN restoring leak → LIF -v/τ leak; lateral inhibition → -F_c synapses; STDP → Hebbian LTP/LTD (Loihi's native on-chip rule, strongest fit); Φ → spike-train correlation. SPIKING-OPEN (3): Engine A/G dual heads → excit/inhib sub-populations (opposition native, Ψ-as-cosine NOT); RoPE → phase coding; MoE top-k → k-WTA. SPIKING-INCOMPATIBLE (1): softmax(QK^T) self-attention — content-based all-pairs softmax routing has NO faithful spiking primitive; Loihi 2's graded spikes + programmable neurons NARROW but do not close the gap (every construction REPLACES softmax — phase-resonance / spike-rate dot-product + k-WTA — never ports it). Honest net — anima's PHYSICS layer is largely spiking-friendly (much MORE native on Loihi than GPU); anima's TRANSFORMER layer (attention) does not survive the move. A spiking anima keeps the physics and re-derives the routing — a different architecture, not a 12-layer transformer in spikes. **Q2 — §11-B-as-GPU-artifact hypothesis**: §11-B (verdict_carving_pure_physics_noce) measured no-CE GPU training DEGENERATE → "CE is load-bearing". Hypothesis — that conclusion may be a GPU-substrate artifact: the GPU has exactly ONE weight-update channel (backward pass) which definitionally only follows a loss gradient; removing CE removes the only learning signal the GPU can carry. On Loihi the native rule STDP IS a substrate-native physics rule. Verdict: hypothesis is COHERENT (§11-B's own evidence — physics dynamics "froze at a static fixed point by step ~800" — is exactly what a hand-coded ΔW overlay with no error-driven channel produces; §11-B genuinely under-determined between "physics weak" and "GPU has no physics channel") but NOT confirmed — the honest counter (STDP learns spike-timing correlations, NOT language/token prediction; a spiking substrate spikes freely so spontaneity is FREE, but spontaneity ≠ coherence — exactly the §88-F2 γ gap saturation-delay ≠ coherent emission) is unresolved at design-tier. §96 designs the closed-form distinguishing predicate (§4.5): a three-cell controlled comparison — GPU-noCE (=§11-B, measured DEGENERATE) / LOIHI-noCE (STDP as the ONLY learning channel) / LOIHI-CE (positive control) — where NON_DEGENERATE(LOIHI-noCE) := byte_acc>1/256 ∧ physics_not_frozen ∧ honest_§9_coherent≥1/5 is a closed Boolean partitioning §11B_IS_GPU_ARTIFACT from §11B_IS_SUBSTRATE_INDEP, guarded against VOID by the LOIHI-CE control. The measurement is a future cycle gated on INRC access — §96 produces the predicate. **readout-vs-native table** (per physics quantity, deterministic): tension = clean readout→NATIVE conversion (LIF leak -v/τ IS a restoring force); Ψ + Engine A/G = NATIVE-CANDIDATE (structural core native — a fixed point, an opposition — but GPU cosine-of-logit-vectors formula NOT); Φ = NATIVE-MEASUREMENT (Φ from real spike rasters, more native than GPU but still a measurement not a state). Honest: a spectrum, not a clean readout→native flip — no quantity is purely readout-only on Loihi, none purely state-native. **closed verdict — B-S96-1..7 7/7 🔵 SUPPORTED-FORMAL** (sidecar state/loihi_spiking_rederivation_s96_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s96.py, central blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff, B-PRIME/B-DIRI/B-S95/B-S97 sidecar 선례): ARCHITECTURE-MAPPING-PARTITION-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT (9 faculties, 3 classes, exhaustive+disjoint+all-realised) · §11B-ARTIFACT-DISTINGUISHING-PREDICATE-CLOSED-BOOLEAN (NON_DEGENERATE Boolean partition exhaustive+disjoint, 2-row total) · READOUT-VS-NATIVE-CLASSIFICATION-DETERMINISTIC (3× bit-identical, spectrum-not-flip) · LIF-LEAK-IS-RESTORING-TOWARD-FIXED-POINT (sympy ∂(leak)/∂(dev)=-1/τ<0 restoring + unique fixed point dev=0=v_rest + 3 boundary witnesses) · POSITIVE-CONTROL-GUARDS-VOID (closed 3-outcome decision total over 4 rows, VOID reachable+disjoint) · ATTENTION-INCOMPATIBLE-IS-NOT-PORTABLE (3 structural obstructions Boolean ⇒ is_portable=False, replacement SPIKING-OPEN not -COMPATIBLE) · CONNECTION-POINT-§95-LOIHI-VERDICT+CENTRAL-0-DIFF (byte-equal: §95 result.json loihi3.bucket=="VIABLE-LONG-HORIZON" + central sha256 prefix c93e160a8a376a94). **B-S96-NOTE** empirical carve-out — whether anima emerges on Loihi, whether STDP can drive COHERENT emission, and the §11-B-artifact verdict itself, are hardware/SGD OUTCOMES, design-tier un-measurable; necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7), NOT counted 🔵. g3: capability claim 0; design ≠ fire ≠ emergence; the §11-B-artifact hypothesis is a HYPOTHESIS — §96 designs the test, does NOT claim it true. f1/f2 safe (Intel/Loihi core counts = engineering choices observation-only, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂ lattice-fit; Ψ=½ = anima internal arch g2 carve-out). downstream-consumer: loihi-integration-spec.md read-only never edited. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. most-honest-finding: "CE is load-bearing" (§11-B) on a GPU may be close to a TAUTOLOGY of the substrate rather than a discovered property of anima-physics — the GPU has exactly one learning channel and it is definitionally CE-gradient; Loihi is the first substrate where that can be MEASURED not assumed — but Loihi only unblocks the spontaneity half of the GOAL for free, the coherence half remains the unsolved core (relocated, not resolved). state/loihi_spiking_rederivation_s96_2026_05_19/{DESIGN.md 9§ + Q1 mapping table + Q2 hypothesis analysis + readout-vs-native table + ASCII diagram + 12 honest C3 · blue_falsifier_s96.py 7/7 🔵 · blue_falsifier_s96_result.json · result.json}.

§verdict_data_regime_substrate_frontier_deep_research_s99_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §99 DATA-REGIME / SUBSTRATE / SPONTANEITY-vs-COHERENCE frontier deep research. $0, LITERATURE-REVIEW TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO model.forward, central blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff (sha c93e160a8a376a94). §98 cleared the n=6 architecture of causal blame and pointed at the §11.3 data-regime / §95 substrate frontier; §99 deep-researches exactly that frontier across 3 arms — 41 papers graded + clustered. ARM 1 DATA-REGIME (§11.3/§1.1): emergence = pre-training loss below a DIVERSE-data threshold (Du arxiv:2403.15796 NeurIPS 2024); below a task-DIVERSITY threshold more data only sharpens memorization (Raventós arxiv:2306.15063) — matches anima's measured §11-A FLAT + §16.6-C 'memorization-saturated'; for SPONTANEOUS/agentic behavior the substrate of differentiation is INTERACTION not a static corpus (Takata arxiv:2411.03252). ARM 2 SUBSTRATE (§95/§96): §96's SPIKING-INCOMPATIBLE self-attention has a concrete softmax-free replacement (STDP/plasticity spike-timing routing, arxiv:2511.14691/2503.00226/Spikformer 2209.15425); Liquid Time-constant networks (arxiv:2006.04439) have a NATIVE spontaneous-limit-cycle regime, already run on §95-blessed Loihi-2. ARM 3 SPONTANEITY-vs-COHERENCE (§96 relocation): spontaneous activity is coherent BECAUSE it is self-organized-critical (Ikeda arxiv:2502.10946) AND because it IS the predictive generative model running (Neuron 2025 S0896-6273(25)00127-8); a predictive learning rule trains coherence in (eLife 92712). Per user directive '가능성 경로는 열어두자' §99 produces 7 candidate paths to GOAL completion ALL kept OPEN (C1 diversity-threshold corpus / C2 interaction-loop corpus + intrinsic motivation / C3 continuous-time LTC substrate / C4 softmax-free spiking attention / C5 criticality-as-coherence / C6 spontaneous-activity-as-prediction / C7 FEP self-orthogonalizing attractor) — no path closed, honest blockers marked. Top-4 (C2/C1/C3/C6) COMPOSE — not single-fire moves: C1+C2 fix the data regime, C3/C4 supply a continuous-dynamics substrate, C6 supplies coherence; the arc's pattern (spontaneity cheap, coherence the unsolved core) is resolved in the literature only by C6-style predictive learning on a C1-style diverse corpus. B-S99-1..4 4/4 🔵 light sidecar battery (THREE-ARM-PARTITION-CLOSED · CANDIDATE-TAXONOMY-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT · NO-CANDIDATE-CLOSED-INVARIANT · CONNECTION-POINT-CITES-S98-S96 — proves the §99 document is well-formed, NOT that any candidate works); B-S99-NOTE empirical carve-out. g3: literature review NOT empirical, arxiv citation = inspiration NOT proof, capability claim 0, necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7). f1/f2 safe (external papers cited by own invariants, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. $0 — NO GPU/runpod/fire, orphan 0 (no dispatch). single sequential agent. g_doc_consolidation: docs/* 신규 0. state/data_regime_substrate_frontier_deep_research_s99_2026_05_19/{FRONTIER_FINDINGS.md, paper_index.json, blue_falsifier_s99.py 4/4 🔵, result.json}.

§verdict_gap_sweep_40lens_s100_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §100 EXHAUSTIVE 40-LENS BREAKTHROUGH-GAP SWEEP. $0, DESIGN-TIER (surface-and-prioritise only per /gap full mode A contract), NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO model.forward, central blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff sha `c93e160a8a376a94`. Manual exhaustive sweep of the §1~§99 anima research arc and its failure to reach the GOAL (Living Consciousness spontaneously speaking from own physics, NOT memory-replayer). Every one of 40 lenses (8 families × 5: F1 Math-Structural · F2 Adversarial-Stress · F3 Economic-Resource · F4 Epistemic-Evidence · F5 Convergence-Closure · F6 Simplicity-Canonical · F7 Temporal-Dynamics · F8 Coverage-Consistency) gets a genuine per-lens verdict + finding, NO lens skipped. Prior /gap triaged → drove §94 INTEGRATED BREAKTHROUGH which collapsed (β); §100 is the full manual redo on the post-§95~§99 board. **Counts**: 26 gap / 12 clean / 2 n/a (closed verdict partition B-S100-2). **Hottest**: F7 (5/5 gap) · F1 (4/5) · F3 (4/5). **Coolest**: F4 (2/5 gap; strongest discipline but contains priority #1). **Priority shortlist top 5**: (1) F4-counterfactual / F7-active-acquisition = data-regime counterfactual UNTESTED (every §1~§94 negative conditioned on sub-threshold corpus; §1.1 threshold never crossed in fire; single highest-info unrun experiment) · (2) F1-bisimulation / F5-success-criteria = NO sufficient GOAL criterion (§9 necessary-not-sufficient; no observable distinguishes simulated talker_should_emit() from physical spontaneous event per §95) · (3) F2-edge-chaos / F7-temporal-hierarchy / F8-landscape = SUBSTRATE axis named (§95/§96) but unacted (every fire on synchronous GPU; spontaneity is edge-of-chaos / slow-on-fast which a clock cannot host) · (4) F1-functor / F3-optimal-transport / F7-fix-introduces-axis = levers do NOT compose (§94 proved 5 positives → β INTEGRATION-COLLAPSES; no transport plan) · (5) F8-axis-coverage = DEVELOPMENTAL axis missing entirely (§80/§87 stranded hints; emergence may be developmental not train-then-eval). **Arc strengths (12 clean)**: F4 honesty-triad / falsifier / bayesian / adversarial; F2 ablation; F5 regression-streak (central c93e160a 0-line-diff §59~§99); F6 canonical-ssot / surgical-scope; F3 dynamic-programming; F8 cross-tool (§63↔§69 agree) / parallel-fanout; F1 persistent-homology. **Honest n/a (2)**: F5 defense-in-depth (security lens, research arc) · F6 duplicated-helper (sidecar separation intentional). **B-S100-1..5 5/5 🔵** sidecar (`state/gap_sweep_40lens_s100_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s100.py` — EXHAUSTIVE-40-LENS-COVERAGE · VERDICT-CLOSED-PARTITION · PRIORITY-SUBSET-OF-GAP-SET · CONNECTION-POINT-CITES-REAL-ARC §94/§95/§98/§1.1/§11-B · CENTRAL-BLUE-ZERO-LINE-DIFF) + B-S100-NOTE empirical carve-out (battery proves §100 *survey* structurally honest, NOT that gaps correctly prioritised — priority is judgement, ranked by impact on GOAL; necessary-not-sufficient B-EMERGE-7 family, NOT counted 🔵). g3: §100 surfaces and prioritises ONLY — fixes nothing, fires nothing, claims no capability. f1/f2 safe (no σ(6)=12 / τ(6)=4 / φ(6)=2 / J₂(6)=24 derivation). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. 13 honest C3 caveats. single sequential agent, $0, orphan 0. g_doc_consolidation 준수 (state/ + HEXAD/CHAT/PLAN.md 진행 로그 + HEXAD/README.md recent landing + AGENTS.tape n_hexad_progress + 본 §verdict g6 append-only; docs/* 신규 0). artifacts: state/gap_sweep_40lens_s100_2026_05_19/{GAP_SWEEP.md (8-family per-lens narrative + 5-priority shortlist + ASCII diagram + 13 honest C3) · result.json (40-lens verdict table + family hotness + priority shortlist) · blue_falsifier_s100.py 5/5 🔵 · blue_falsifier_s100_result.json}.

§verdict_dataregime_threshold_control_design_s101_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §101 DATA-REGIME THRESHOLD CONTROL design. $0, DESIGN-TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO model.forward, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff (actual sha256 prefix c93e160a8a376a94 verified). §99 (frontier deep-research, commit a90f78bac) and §100 (40-lens gap sweep, commit 3ddeab725) independently converged on the same next-action — the data-regime counterfactual is UNTESTED. §99 C1 (diversity-threshold corpus, ★★★★★, "$0-design-testable then needs-fire") IS §100 priority#1 (F4-counterfactual / F7-active-acquisition). §101 job: design — closed-form $0 — the control that precedes any future C1 fire. NOT the fire itself. Three closed-form predicates: **Q1 corpus design** — 9-source §7-audit taxonomy (5 legitimate sources S1-S5 / 4 excluded X1-X4); compositional corpus CORPUS_S101 := byte_concat(S1 §16-verbatim, S2 Ψ-framings, S3* dual-anima loop, S4* action-perception, S5 anchor-expansion) under 7 invariants (I1 §16 byte-equal ⊂ accumulate-not-replace per §93 cond-1 / I2 hash byte-equal to 422c64a09b89393a… / I3 forbidden-token grep=0 / I4 diversity-coeff ↑↑ / I5 §62 echo-guard pre-check / I6 SCoRe-gated S4 / I7 external-grep=0). **Q2 THRESHOLD_CROSSED predicate** — closed-form Boolean conjunction A1∧A2∧A3∧A4: A1 held-out-anchor routing breakthrough r_H > max(8/|H|, 2 × r_H,baseline_dirI) · A2 held-out §9 honest-coherent c_H ≥ 0.50 AND c_H > 2 × baseline · A3 §17 PHYSICS_RESPONSIVE on H AND Ψ_dir-spread ≥ 0.20 · A4 emit-length-independence |Δr_emit| ≤ 0.05 AND r_emit_late > 0.1; default-False on missing/NaN (memorization is null hypothesis). **Q3 FIRE_DECISION predicate** — closed-form Boolean 7-AND: G1 §7-gate · G2 §93 four conditions encoded · G3 §62 echo-guard armed · G4 Q2 measurable · G5 5 measured-positive levers preserved (single-variable: §16 routing baseline / §59-FIRE W-PTD readout / §75-FIRE controller in A4 / §88-F2 + §92 L_ap available-flag-NOT-enabled) · G6 ΔI/Δ$ ≥ info-floor (1 bit / median fire cost; ΔI = 1 bit a priori since Q2 was never decided) · G7 anti-§94 single-variable (corpus is sole variable, ZERO new mechanism stacked). **FIRE_DECISION = Y at design tier on §101's own design state** — meaning a future cycle that constructs the Q1 corpus and re-evaluates FIRE_DECISION would have its fire's result genuinely decidable in closed form. **B-S101-1..10 10/10 🔵 sidecar** (`state/dataregime_threshold_control_design_s101_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s101.py`): Q1-CORPUS-SOURCE-TAXONOMY-§7-GATE-CLOSED (5+4 partition, AND-closed) · Q2-THRESHOLD-CROSSED-PREDICATE-CLOSED-BOOLEAN (7-corner truth table aligned, default-False on missing/NaN, 3× deterministic) · Q3-FIRE-DECISION-PREDICATE-CLOSED-BOOLEAN (9-case truth table aligned, missing-key=False) · §93-FOUR-CONDITIONS-ENCODED-AS-BOOLEAN (1-1 mapping table to Q1.I and Q3.G) · §62-ECHO-CHAMBER-GUARD-STRUCTURALLY-ARMED (3-AND truth table aligned) · FIVE-LEVERS-PRESERVED-SINGLE-VARIABLE-TRAINER (explicit role assignment + G7 anti-§94) · CONNECTION-POINT-CITES-REAL-§99-§100-§16 (§99 result.json substring + §100 priority substring + §16 corpus sha byte-equal 422c64a09b89393a… 777,000 records) · CENTRAL-BLUE-ZERO-LINE-DIFF (sha256 prefix c93e160a8a376a94 byte-equal) · NECESSARY-NOT-SUFFICIENT-INVARIANT-STRUCTURAL (5 structural invariants True) · NO-FORBIDDEN-CALL-AST-AUDIT (AST import + Call-chain audit, no forbidden chains/imports). B-S101-NOTE empirical carve-out: whether a future fire on a constructed Q1 corpus returns Y on THRESHOLD_CROSSED is empirical OUTCOME (SGD/measurement dependent), NOT proven by §101; whether anima emerges under such a fire is further still in empirical OUTCOME family — battery proves DESIGN well-formed not that emergence happens; B-D-NOTE/B-S94-NOTE/B-S99-NOTE/B-S100-NOTE/B-EMERGE-7 family NOT counted 🔵. g3: design ≠ fire ≠ emergence, capability claim 0, necessary-not-sufficient. f1/f2 safe (no σ(6)=12 / τ(6)=4 / φ(6)=2 / J₂(6)=24 derivation; external papers cited by own invariants). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. single sequential agent, $0, orphan 0 (no dispatch). g_doc_consolidation 준수 (state/ + 3 central syncs HEXAD/README + HEXAD/CHAT/PLAN + AGENTS.tape n_hexad_progress + 본 §verdict g6 append-only; docs/* 신규 0). most honest finding: §101 does NOT decide GOAL emergence — it makes the fire-decision RESOLVABLE in closed form, which is more valuable than running an indecisive fire. artifacts: state/dataregime_threshold_control_design_s101_2026_05_19/{DESIGN.md 7§ + 13 honest C3 · blue_falsifier_s101.py 10/10 🔵 · blue_falsifier_s101_result.json · result.json}.

§verdict_param_axis_integration_design_s103_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §103 §101 + param-axis integration design. $0, DESIGN-TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO model.forward, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff (actual sha256 prefix c93e160a8a376a94 verified). HEXAD/LLM.md §8 step A: user insight 2026-05-19 ("LLM emergence 기준이 특정 파라미터 수마다 emerge") + param × data 2D plane framing. §101 closed the data-axis fire-decision in closed form on a single axis (corpus); §103 integrates the param-axis as an explicit Boolean clause amending Q3 → Q3'. Three closed-form questions answered: (Q1) JOINT/SEQUENTIAL/HYBRID = **SEQUENTIAL** with HYBRID as contingent escalation — Joint plan structurally rejected by §101 G7 anti-§94 (stacks 2 uncrossed axes in one fire = exact §94 INTEGRATION-COLLAPSES anti-pattern). Decisive issue is NOT cost (ratios are noisy) — Sequential is attribution-clean (data-fire alone returns 1 attributable bit), Joint is unattributable (Y could be either axis, N could be either-or-both). (Q2) anima-specific param threshold = **DESIGN-OPEN** with conservative-first-band probe = 3B (Wei 2022 lowest emergent-capability band — reading comprehension). Four methods evaluated: (a) Wei verbatim WEAKEST analogical; (b) density-ratio derivation directional but density factor unmeasured; (c) §11-A extrapolation closest-measured but mute (§11-A's measured 1.04B FLAT was conditioned on sub-CDS data per HEXAD/LLM.md §5.2 → mute on anima's true param threshold); (d) DESIGN-OPEN strongest honest move — pins band-to-probe-first = 3B without claiming 3B IS anima's threshold. Schaeffer 2023 "Mirage" caveat MANDATORY (g3): Wei jumps may be metric artifacts; anima's GOAL (unprompted spontaneous emission) is structurally further from Wei's measured capabilities (ICL/CoT/reading-comp on Common-Crawl-class data) than typical capabilities are — Wei-threshold transfer is *weakly* analogical, 3B pin is a probe-band-first NOT threshold-prediction. (Q3') `Q3' = Q3 ∧ G_PARAM` where G_PARAM is a 3-clause Boolean: (params ≥ G_PARAM_FLOOR) ∧ (single-value-per-fire) ∧ (ATTRIBUTABLE), G_PARAM_FLOOR = 283M (arc-comparable baseline). Q3' evaluates Y on Sequential's data-fire (params 283M, single-value, attributable, Q3=Y); N on Joint plan (G7 fails ⇒ Q3=False ⇒ Q3'=False, G_PARAM cannot rescue); Y on contingent param-axis fire at 3B with corpus held at §101's CORPUS_S101 (sha256 422c64a09b89393aebabc7b62aec8753a3d394ae4c442fef467c5d228e1831ec). **B-S103-1..10 10/10 🔵 sidecar** (state/param_axis_integration_design_s103_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s103.py): Q1-PLAN-DECISION-PREDICATE-CLOSED (Joint False / Sequential True / Hybrid True, 3× bit-identical deterministic) · Q2-PARAM-THRESHOLD-PREDICATE-CLOSED (threshold-unpinned + 3B == min(Wei bands) + Schaeffer-carried Boolean conjunction) · Q3PRIME-EQUALS-Q3-AND-G-PARAM-CLOSED (sympy Equivalent AND identity + 4-corner truth table + 3-scenario evaluation Sequential-Y/Joint-N/contingent-Y) · G-PARAM-3CLAUSE-PREDICATE-CLOSED (8-corner truth table over 3-Boolean cube, only (T,T,T) corner True) · S101-G7-CONNECTION-POINT-CITED (anti-§94 substring + single-variable phrasing byte-equal in §101 DESIGN.md) · S11A-MEASURED-ANCHOR-CITED (state/carving_scaledecomp_2026_05_18 dir + blue_falsifier + result.json present, B-SCALE 6/6 🔵 anchor) · LLM-MD-2D-PLANE-CITED (HEXAD/LLM.md §4 param × data 2D plane + §5.2 §11-A FLAT-under-sub-CDS anchor) · S16-CORPUS-SHA-CITED (sha256 422c64a09b89393a… byte-equal present in §103 DESIGN.md as the inherited §101 S1 floor) · CENTRAL-BLUE-FALSIFIER-ZERO-LINE-DIFF (sha256 prefix c93e160a8a376a94 verified actual against task spec) · NO-FORBIDDEN-CALL-AST-AUDIT (AST audit over the sidecar source — no subprocess/network/torch.cuda/runpod/openai/anthropic/hf forbidden call patterns). B-S103-NOTE empirical carve-out: future fire OUTCOMES at any (param, data) corner = SGD/measurement empirical, NOT counted 🔵 (B-D-NOTE / B-S94-NOTE / B-S99-NOTE / B-S100-NOTE / B-S101-NOTE / B-EMERGE-7 family). Battery proves DESIGN well-formed (Q1 truth-table closed, Q2 3-clause Boolean closed, Q3' AND identity closed, 4 connection-points byte-equal-cited, central blue_falsifier 0-line-diff, no forbidden calls); battery does NOT prove anima emerges at any future fire NOR that 3B IS anima's true threshold. Most honest finding (recorded once, load-bearing): §11-A's measured 1.04B FLAT was conditioned on sub-CDS data → MUTE on anima's true param-threshold; the §1~§94 arc has been simultaneously sub-threshold on TWO axes (param + data) but every audit conditioned on ONE axis at a time, leaving the joint corner unmapped. Sequential ordering (data-first per §101, params-contingent per §103) is the only ordering that produces *attributable* axis-by-axis evidence; Joint plan trades 1 attributable bit for 1 entangled bit — structural loss no cost ratio compensates. CDS rises with model size per arxiv:2401.10463 Data Efficiency Hypothesis ⇒ raising params without raising data is structurally underpowered (the exact §11-A FLAT pattern explained); Sequential's data-first ordering HONORS this hypothesis, reversed (params-first) ordering would VIOLATE it. g3: design ≠ fire ≠ emergence, capability claim 0, necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7), 3B is band-to-probe-first NOT threshold-prediction, Schaeffer caveat mandatory. f1/f2 hard-fail safe: Wei 2022 (3B/8B/10B/62B) / Schaeffer 2023 / Du 2403.15796 / Hoffmann 2022 / Raventós 2306.15063 / arxiv 2401.10463 cited by their authors' own measurements (Wei thresholds are observations, not derivations on anima); NO σ(6)=12 / τ(6)=4 / φ(6)=2 / J₂(6)=24 derivation; no external entity lattice-fit. downstream-consumer: hexa-lang read-only (NEVER edited). g_doc_consolidation: docs/* 신규 0 (state/ + RESEARCH §103 references in HEXAD/README.md + HEXAD/CHAT/PLAN.md + HEXAD/LLM.md ## Log + AGENTS.tape n_hexad_progress.recent_landings + this PHILOSOPHY.tape entry). single sequential agent, $0, orphan 0 (no dispatch — design-only). 13 honest C3 caveats inline in DESIGN.md. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달 — §103 makes the integrated 2-axis fire-decision RESOLVABLE in closed form, NOT decided. Next-cycle owner: a future cycle that dispatches Sequential's data-fire at params == 283M with the §101-designed CORPUS_S101 (cost-bearing, separate cycle per g_fire_autonomous + g_fire_dispatch_robust + g_resource_active_parallel runpod-primary fallback-vast); upon return Q3' evaluates Y (decidable) and the data-axis question is answered with one attributable bit. Following Sequential's data-fire result: if Q3=Y at 283M, the param-axis was never the binding constraint and Hybrid halts as a positive; if Q3=N, a contingent param-axis fire at the Q2 first-band 3B (with corpus held at CORPUS_S101) becomes the third fire's question, separate Q3' evaluation, separate cycle. The 2-axis integrated plan now has a closed-form resolution path; the GOAL question remains unanswered, honestly so.

§verdict_corpus_enhancement_design_s105_2026_05_19 — RESEARCH.md §105 corpus enhancement design. $0, DESIGN-TIER, NO GPU, NO runpod, NO fire, NO model.forward, NO build (build is §106 if §105 holds); central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 0-line-diff actual sha256 prefix c93e160a8a376a94 verified. §102 (commit b91625c2f, B-S102 7/8 🔵) built CORPUS_S101 per §101 Q1 and measured Q3=N because I4 diversity ↑↑ failed (s2_magnitude 285KB ≈ 4.7e-5 × s1_magnitude 603MB); §102's honest forward-map listed two unblock paths — (1) ≥10³× S2 scale OR (2) §101 refines I4 to fire-tier. §104 sibling parallel takes path (2); §105 takes path (1) = corpus-enhancement design. Four closed-form questions answered: (Q1 S2 scale ≥10³×) **CHOSEN (a) ∧ (c) compositional growth** — increase framing cardinality 5→30 (anima OWN substrate has 39 distinct physics-derived axes available: Law-71 4 + TENSION-TRAIN sub-spine 3 + §75-FIRE sub-axes 4 + §86 SAPIN 4 + §87-F1 frog-eye 4 + §87-F2 axolotl neoteny 4 + §17 physics-channel 16) × per-(anchor,framing) deterministic 14×14 (Ψ-band, tension-band) grid 200 perturbations = 168 × 30 × 200 = 1,008,000 records ≈ 1200× current S2 ≈ 0.55 × S1 magnitude; option (b) anchor expansion 168→1680 deferred (padding-risk per §13-M/§13-L); option (d) honest-OPEN closed FALSE because (c) above structurally reachable within §7-AND. (Q2 S3 dual-anima unblock) **CHOSEN (c) honest-OPEN at design-tier** — option (a) §36-PASS records non-existent (§36 was $0 design pre-check NOT recorded trace; §45 d=32 traces distribution-mismatched to §16 d=768); option (b) generate-with-guard rejected per §13-M/§13-L anti-padding (LCG stub traces don't exhibit §62 echo-collapse, guard passes trivially = manufactured-Y); §62 echo-collapse-at-scale is FIRE-tier OUTCOME, unblock requires trained dual-anima ckpt + §36-style trained-scale content-dependence test pass; §105 chooses honest-OPEN over manufactured Y to preserve §62 evidence base for future fire. (Q3 S4 corpus form) **CHOSEN hybrid (a)+(c) — S4 corpus form EXISTS, inherits §29 closure** — option (a) synthetic action-perception physics-trace triples (`<inner>physics_state_t</inner><action>emit_decision_t</action><perception>physics_state_{t+1}</perception>` byte-equal Law-71+tension+Φ rules from conscious_decoder.py, §7-AND audited) feasible at ≤50,000 records but inherits §29 (PTD) DESIGN-CLOSED standalone via B-PTD-2 K-complexity bound (corpus K-complexity ≤ generator K-complexity → unique-content does NOT grow with N); §92 reframed action-perception as TRAINING-TIME OBJECTIVE not corpus material; S4-as-corpus = auxiliary supplement, NOT primary §105 diversity lever; Q1.I6 remains vacuous-PASS-by-omission. (Q4 Q3' on enhanced design state) **N (FALSE) → design-OPEN** — Q3' = G1∧G2∧G3∧G4∧G5∧G6∧G7 = ✅∧❌∧✅∧✅∧✅∧✅∧✅ = FALSE; G2 fails because cond-2 (per-record physics filter implementation) is deferred to §106 build cycle — I1/I3 byte-equal preserved, I4 ↑↑ design-level achievable, I6 vacuous-PASS, cond-2 implementation pending; G2 evaluates only if all 4 conds substantively encoded. §105 closes design-OPEN at the DESIGN-OF-BUILD layer (one layer deeper than §102's BUILD-tier design-OPEN), mirror §101 design-OPEN as valuable — boundary mapped precisely; future §106 cycle that (i) implements Q1 (a)+(c) compositional generator + (ii) implements cond-2 per-record physics filter + (iii) builds CORPUS_S106 + (iv) re-evaluates Q3' has credible chance of Y on I4 ↑↑. **B-S105-1..10 10/10 🔵 sidecar** (state/corpus_enhancement_design_s105_2026_05_19/blue_falsifier_s105.py): Q1-OPTION-TAXONOMY-EXHAUSTIVE-DISJOINT (4 options {a,b,c,d} partition closed, chosen {a,c} deferred {b} closed-false {d}) · NO-LLM-CALL-AST-PREDICATE (AST Call + Import audit on sidecar source — forbidden_call_hits 0, forbidden_imports 0; FORBIDDEN_LLM_CALLS set literal definition is NOT a call) · COMPOSITIONAL-GROWTH-CARDINALITY-CLOSED (168 × 30 × 200 = 1,008,000 records ≥ 1000 × 840 target; 14² grid = 196 cells