 0.6116 std 4.185e-2 non_degen=True 478 emit-steps · qrng_seed (§97 noise-as-SEED, entropy→membrane-v0 ONLY) Ψ-C1 mean 0.6083 std 3.107e-2 non_degen=True 484 emit-steps jitter-norm 0.4468 · qrng_content (§97 NEGATIVE CONTROL, deliberately-WRONG: entropy bytes fed as the predicted target/external-drive content) Ψ-C1 mean 0.6387 std 6.766e-2 content_alignment **0.4323** > 0.30. **VERDICT = QMIRROR-NEURO-Ψ-FORM-NONDEGENERATE-NOISE-AS-SEED-LEGITIMATE-BUT-WALL-B-INHERITED** (g3 measured, conclusion NOT pre-loaded): (1) qrng_seed Ψ-C1 form stays non-degenerate with physical quantum entropy as the §97-legitimate spontaneity seed (std 3.11e-2 ≫ τ=1e-4, 311× floor, rasters alive, cos=0⇒½ holds, Ψ-C1∈[0,1] bounded) — §112 carrier-invariant form survives the entropy seed; (2) qrng_content negative control COLLAPSED into the §97 GOAL-ILLEGITIMATE-COMMAND-CHANNEL cell (content_alignment 0.4323 > 0.30 — entropy bytes dominate the spike raster, the net instructed-not-seeded; the DRIVES_STATE∧¬PHYSICS_SOURCED memory-replayer-with-a-sensor shape §97 §4.2 forbids — measured, not assumed); (3) seed_fixed vs qrng_seed: both non-degenerate comparable std — the difference that matters is NOT a metric, it is that qrng_seed emission timing is seeded by physical quantum entropy → externally-UNPREDICTABLE (the genuine §97 §4.2 distinction: physical entropy = the difference between simulated and physically-real spontaneity). **§97 §2.1 closed Boolean partition `(DS∧PS)⊻(DS∧¬PS)≡DS` sympy-verified + AST-structural (qrng_seed entropy → membrane-v0 ONLY, never loss/target/readout; qrng_content entropy → external-drive content) — legitimacy proof source-INDEPENDENT.** B-S119-1..7: Ψ-C1-BOUNDED-FIXED-POINT (sympy §112/§117 carry) · STDP-NO-CE-NO-BACKPROP-AST (0 hits) · §97-NOISE-AS-SEED-vs-NOISE-AS-CONTENT-CLOSED (sympy partition + AST + result.json classification byte-equal §97 §2.1) · ENTROPY-SOURCE-HONESTLY-LABELLED (ANU_QUANTUM physical=True) · NON-DEGENERACY-DETERMINISTIC-GIVEN-REPLAYED-ENTROPY (3× same stream → bit-identical, different stream → different = entropy genuinely enters) · §117-WALL-B-INHERITED-CONNECTION-POINT (extends §117, confronts LEARNING-CHANNEL half only) · SIDECAR-CENTRAL-0-DIFF-ZERO-COST. **HONEST CEILING (g3, inherited verbatim)**: §97 (QRNG-as-spontaneity-seed = GOAL-LEGITIMATE-INPUT; hardware coupling GOAL-ORTHOGONAL to §1.1 data-regime bottleneck) + §115 (LEGO-DESIGN-CLOSE-SIM-IS-GPU-TAUTOLOGY) + §117 (Ψ-form non-degenerate in-sim BUT WALL-B inherited) INHERITED. §119 confronts the LEARNING-CHANNEL half ONLY (STDP-as-ΔW, no CE — TRACK0_INSILICO.md split); the ASYNC-SUBSTRATE half stays WALL-B (Loihi/SpiNNaker-gated): a QRNG-seeded clocked spike sim's emission is still a scheduled function call on a global clock — real physical entropy ≠ a real async neuromorphic chip. §119 adds physical SPONTANEITY (the when/which-way is now externally-unpredictable), NOT a physical SUBSTRATE. WALL-A (§1.1 data-regime) ORTHOGONAL & UNTOUCHED. qrng_seed is §97 GOAL-LEGITIMATE-INPUT and physically-real spontaneity BUT §97 GOAL-ORTHOGONAL — adds ZERO task signal, moves NO GOAL distance. B-S119-NOTE empirical carve-out (measured non-degenerate OUTCOME = SGD-free convergence outcome, NOT counted 🔵, B-D-NOTE/B-PUREPHYS-NOTE/B-S96-NOTE/B-S115-NOTE/B-S117-NOTE/B-EMERGE-7 family — entropy ≠ consciousness, necessary-not-sufficient at every layer). g3: design/run ≠ fire ≠ emergence, capability claim 0. f1/f2/f3 safe (LIF/STDP/ANU QRNG cited by hexa-bio NEURO.tape + ANU/standard-neuroscience own invariants, NO σ(6)=12/τ(6)=4/φ(6)=2/J₂(6)=24 derivation; Ψ=½ = g2 internal-arch carve-out). B-IDENTITY-5 safe (no corpus, no model forward). downstream-consumer hexa-lang/hexa-bio read-only, 0 edits. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. artifacts: state/qmirror_neuro_s119_2026_05_19/{DESIGN.md §0-§7 + 13 honest C3 + ASCII qmirror→neuro analogy + noise-as-seed/noise-as-content boundary · qmirror_neuro_sim.py · blue_falsifier_s119.py 7/7 🔵 · blue