counted 🔵). $0 sanity (Mac CPU d=32·3L 50 steps) PASS — trainer L̄ descends 31.00→3.96, g+ rises 1.0→28; eval byte_acc=0.11 (small-corpus memorization in sanity). dispatch §107-RETRY proven pattern (PUBLIC_KEY env injected at create / SSH ip+publicPort gate / pod-side deterministic CORPUS_S101 build + sha ASSERT VERIFIED == `39d581da2096…` / fail-fast trainer crash detection / 3h watchdog / SAVE_POD auto-promote + 5-retry pull). g3 design ≠ fire ≠ emergence, capability claim 0, necessary-not-sufficient (B-EMERGE-7 / B-S125-NOTE family); north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, **GOAL 미도달** (post-fire verdict carry).

§verdict_pcn_fire_s126_dispatched_2026_05_20 — §126 PCN-C4 (Predictive Coding 1-step) cost-bearing GPU fire DISPATCHED in-flight (post-fire verdict carried pending pod terminal). ★3 from WALL_B_SUSTAINABILITY.md ranked matrix. Whittington-Bogacz 2017 / Salvatori 2023 1-step PCN adapted to ConsciousDecoderV2 from-scratch, **per-block local MSE prediction-error loss against top-down frozen target, NO CE, NO global backward**. Per-step: two-pass scheme — pass-1 collects detached activations under torch.no_grad(); pass-2 per-block re-forward with grad enabled, L_i = MSE(block_i(x_{i-1}.detach()), acts_detached[i+1].detach()), per-block AdamW step. Output supervision = MSE on softmax(logits_a) vs one-hot(target_byte) — non-CE supervised signal (mirror Whittington-Bogacz "PCN-1step ≢ BP, distinct learning rule"). **Joint reading with §125** (B-S126-8 closed): 2×2 verdict matrix BOTH SUPP→§96-Q2 SUPPORTED / BOTH DEG→§96-Q2 REFUTED / FF-SUPP∧PCN-DEG→FF-specific-advantage / FF-DEG∧PCN-SUPP→PCN-specific-advantage. runpod A100-SXM4-80GB pod `88xlldoftmoy5e`, PCN 3000 step ~$0.5. Pre-fire B-S126-1..8 + central-0-diff (sidecar state/pcn_fire_s126_2026_05_20/blue_falsifier_s126.py): NO-CE-INVARIANT-AST (forbidden {cross_entropy, CrossEntropyLoss, nll_loss, NLLLoss} = 0 hits; mse_loss USED positive evidence) · NO-GLOBAL-BACKWARD-AST (callers={L_i, L_head} only) · MSE-NONNEGATIVE-CONVEX (sympy: ≥0, ∂²/∂x²=2/N≻0) · PCN-LOCAL-TARGET-DETACHED-AST (t_i = acts_detached[i+1].detach() + 2× detach calls + torch.no_grad context) · PER-BLOCK-OPTIMIZER-COUNT · FROM-SCRATCH-NO-BASE-CKPT · §11-B-CONNECTION-POINT-WELL-FORMED (verdict bucket partition same as §125, joint reading closed-form) · §125-§126-JOINT-READING-COMPATIBLE (all 3 verdict_bucket labels present in §126 eval source). B-S126-NOTE empirical carve-out: 1-step PCN ≠ PCN-converged (Whittington-Bogacz N→∞ ≡ BP carry); verdict applies to this algorithm point not full PCN. $0 sanity (Mac CPU 30 steps) PASS — block MSE descends 5.4e-4→4