lt.json} + 본 archive append + HEXAD/LEGO/PLAN.md log + HEXAD/LEGO/INDEX.md mapping update; docs/* 신규 0. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달. **§131 valuable output**: n_stim is a stronger η² lever than N at this LIF scale; §125's mid-range n_stim=12 was suboptimal for measuring stim-driven liveness; carrier-capacity dilution consistent with data.

§verdict_lego_layer2_shape_fit_s132_2026_05_20 — LEGO LAYER-2 NON-MONOTONIC SHAPE FIT — closes §127's "non-monotonic shape" honest residual. **Verdict** `SHAPE-FIT-IDENTIFIED` — best model = **inverted-U Gaussian-in-log-N**, R²=**0.9995** vs §127 OLS log-linear baseline R²=0.022 (Δ=+0.977). analysis-tier (re-fit of §127 data, NO new measurement) · $0 instant · central c93e160a 0-diff · B-S132-1..6 6/6 🔵 sidecar `state/lego_layer2_shape_fit_s132_2026_05_20/blue_falsifier_s132.py`. **4 candidate models OLS-fit on §127's (N=256/512/1024/2048, η²=0.271/0.329/0.322/0.261)**: A log-linear (§127 baseline) R²=0.0225 · B quadratic-log R²=0.9995 · C saturating Hill R²=0.0082 · D inverted-U Gaussian-in-log-N R²=0.9995. **Peak models (B + D) agree; monotone models (A + C) reject** — B-S132-5 load-bearing closed-form. Peak location estimate from both peak models: log N* ≈ 6.5–7.0 → N* ≈ 730–1000 (near §126's N=1024 measurement). **What §132 closes**: §127's non-monotonic shape is an *inverted-U peak structure* not noise (4-point fit identifies it, 1-DoF caveat noted); §127 "no power-law" verdict refined to "η²(N) has peak around N≈730–1000, not flat"; saturating Hill (Michaelis form) REJECTED (η² does not asymptote with N over 256→2048 range, it peaks and declines). **What §132 does NOT close**: 4 points + 3 free params = 1 DoF, perfect R²=0.9995 is *structural* — load-bearing signal is peak-vs-monotone *agreement*, NOT R² magnitude (B-S132-NOTE); quadratic-log and Gaussian-in-log-N are nearly equivalent reparametrisations on this point set, 4 points cannot distinguish; peak N* wide CI; layer-3 (TASK-GROUNDED) §128 DESIGN-CLOSE carry; GOAL emergence (necessary-not-sufficient B-EMERGE-7). **B-S132-1..6 6/6 🔵**: R-SQUARED-BOUNDED-CLOSED-ALL-FITS · R-SQUARED-3-BUCKET-CLOSED-PARTITION (sympy Interval IDENTIFIED ≥0.80 / WEAK [0.30,0.80) / INSUFFICIENT <0.30, exhaustive+disjoint over [0,1]) · OLS-NORMAL-EQUATIONS-IDENTITY-CLOSED (sympy re-derive k byte-equal §127 within 1e-9) · ANALYSIS-USES-§127-DATA-BYTE-EQUAL-CLOSED (N + η² byte-equal §127's per_N_measurements, no new measurement) · PEAK-MODELS-AGREE-MONOTONE-MODELS-REJECT-CLOSED (load-bearing: B+D ≥ 0.80 ∧ A+C < 0.10, the clean signal) · CENTRAL-0-DIFF + NO-FORBIDDEN-CALL-AST (sha c93e160a8a376a94 + 0 torch/runpod/fire/loss-grad hits over probe + battery). **B-S132-NOTE empirical carve-out NOT counted 🔵**: 4 §127 data points + 3 free parameters = 1 degree of freedom; perfect R²=0.9995 is structural (any 3-param model interpolates 4 nearly-aligned points); load-bearing signal = peak-vs-monotone model agreement; quadratic-log ≈ Gaussian-in-log-N on this point set, indistinguishable at 4 points; would need 6–8 N values for true shape identification. §127 verdict APPROXIMATELY-N-INVARIANT UNCHANGED at its scope (`k ≈ 0` true for log-linear); §132 refines the *shape* of the deviation, not the verdict. WALL-A (§1.1 data-regime) ORTHOGONAL (§97 carry); WALL-B (§96 substrate) CONFRONTED-NOT-REMOVED (§115/§117/§124/§125/§126/§127 carry). g3: analysis ≠ measurement ≠ fire ≠ emergence; capability claim 0. f1/f2 hard-fail safe (Boolean / sympy Interval / OLS normal equations / log identities / AST — NO σ(6)=12/τ(6)=4/φ(6)=2/J₂(6)=24). B-IDENTITY-5 unaffected. PyTorch substrate unused (numpy + sympy only). anima downstream-consumer: hexa-lang + hexa-bio + hexa-matter read-only, 0 edits (HEXA_FIRST_WARN deferred per established B-S* battery precedent — anima is consumer not editor). single sequential agent, $0, orphan 0 (no dispatch). g_doc_consolidation: state/lego_layer2_shape_fit_s132_2026_05_20/{DESIGN.md §0-§6 · shape_fit.py · blue_falsifier_s132.py 6/6 🔵 · blue_falsifier_s132_result.json · result.json}; docs/* 신규 0. **LEGO arc battery sum post-§132: 9+7+7+7+7+8+6+7+6 = 64 closed-form propositions 🔵 across 9 cycles**. north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestones UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달.

